1
00:00:00,587 --> 00:00:03,990
(Evening of Day 3)

2
00:00:07,827 --> 00:00:10,964
(A new letter arrives at the House.)

3
00:00:11,998 --> 00:00:13,132
(Spots it)

4
00:00:14,701 --> 00:00:15,935
(Glances)

5
00:00:17,604 --> 00:00:18,538
Ye Ji.

6
00:00:19,472 --> 00:00:20,373
Ro Bin.

7
00:00:21,174 --> 00:00:23,009
- Are Ye Ji and Ro Bin here?
- What?

8
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:24,978
Please come downstairs.

9
00:00:24,978 --> 00:00:25,945
Okay.

10
00:00:26,779 --> 00:00:28,081
- Is Ro Bin inside too?
- Yes.

11
00:00:28,081 --> 00:00:29,082
Okay.

12
00:00:31,251 --> 00:00:32,719
I'd better hurry down.

13
00:00:35,054 --> 00:00:36,256
Okay.

14
00:00:36,256 --> 00:00:38,691
(Everyone gathers in one place.)

15
00:00:39,459 --> 00:00:41,127
- Let's go.
- Everyone, pay attention.

16
00:00:41,127 --> 00:00:42,495
I'll reveal it now.

17
00:00:44,631 --> 00:00:46,199
It's Day Three.

18
00:00:46,566 --> 00:00:47,567
Day Three.

19
00:00:48,101 --> 00:00:51,771
From this moment on, you may share
all information about yourselves.

20
00:00:53,206 --> 00:00:54,641
We're loving it.

21
00:00:54,641 --> 00:00:56,242
"Gather together and talk."

22
00:00:56,242 --> 00:00:58,311
The moment has finally come.

23
00:00:58,311 --> 00:01:00,213
Who goes first? This is nerve-racking.

24
00:01:00,947 --> 00:01:05,151
(Tonight, they reveal
their ages and occupations.)

25
00:01:05,852 --> 00:01:11,057
(How will this change their feelings?)

26
00:01:11,624 --> 00:01:12,859
(The moment has come.)

27
00:01:12,859 --> 00:01:14,027
I've been dying to know.

28
00:01:14,027 --> 00:01:16,162
- Seriously.
- Their ages and jobs.

29
00:01:16,162 --> 00:01:18,331
This could completely...

30
00:01:18,331 --> 00:01:19,966
Change the dynamics.

31
00:01:19,966 --> 00:01:22,502
The love lines could really shift now.

32
00:01:22,502 --> 00:01:23,836
Absolutely.

33
00:01:23,836 --> 00:01:26,005
I think they needed this moment.

34
00:01:26,005 --> 00:01:27,540
Right. They need to know.

35
00:01:27,540 --> 00:01:28,408
Once they do...

36
00:01:28,408 --> 00:01:31,177
I'm sure Do Gon must be having...

37
00:01:31,177 --> 00:01:32,412
the hardest time right now.

38
00:01:33,112 --> 00:01:34,747
Ro Bin keeps saying...

39
00:01:34,747 --> 00:01:37,183
she doesn't want a large age gap.

40
00:01:37,183 --> 00:01:39,085
What if Do Gon is younger than her?

41
00:01:39,252 --> 00:01:40,153
(Realizes)

42
00:01:40,153 --> 00:01:42,322
Right. We still don't know.

43
00:01:42,322 --> 00:01:43,256
(That possibility still remains.)

44
00:01:43,256 --> 00:01:44,424
Once they reveal it...

45
00:01:44,424 --> 00:01:46,259
Do Gon could be younger.

46
00:01:46,259 --> 00:01:47,126
"Ms. Seo Ro Bin."

47
00:01:47,126 --> 00:01:48,294
I didn't think of that.

48
00:01:48,294 --> 00:01:49,796
All of a sudden...

49
00:01:49,796 --> 00:01:51,331
"Ms. Seo."

50
00:01:51,331 --> 00:01:53,466
I totally missed that possibility.

51
00:01:53,867 --> 00:01:55,501
(Excited)

52
00:01:55,501 --> 00:01:57,270
How should we decide the order?

53
00:01:57,270 --> 00:01:59,505
I'd like to see the photos,

54
00:01:59,505 --> 00:02:02,442
and follow the story up to their jobs.

55
00:02:02,442 --> 00:02:03,343
Photos?

56
00:02:03,943 --> 00:02:05,445
The albums tell our stories...

57
00:02:05,445 --> 00:02:08,414
from infancy to adulthood.

58
00:02:08,414 --> 00:02:09,449
Really?

59
00:02:10,416 --> 00:02:12,619
(2 hours earlier)

60
00:02:13,887 --> 00:02:16,523
(Na Young wanders the living room alone.)

61
00:02:17,056 --> 00:02:18,224
(Startled)

62
00:02:18,224 --> 00:02:21,127
(She finds mysterious photo albums.)

63
00:02:21,127 --> 00:02:24,063
There were some books here,

64
00:02:24,063 --> 00:02:26,466
and this looked like a photo album,
so I checked.

65
00:02:26,466 --> 00:02:27,767
The pictures...

66
00:02:27,767 --> 00:02:29,168
- Are they ours?
- Yeah.

67
00:02:29,168 --> 00:02:30,103
Really?

68
00:02:30,103 --> 00:02:32,105
They all look like childhood photos.

69
00:02:32,105 --> 00:02:33,172
(Gasps)

70
00:02:33,172 --> 00:02:34,941
How did we not know about these?

71
00:02:35,642 --> 00:02:38,077
(Jong Eun brings over eight albums.)

72
00:02:38,077 --> 00:02:39,279
No way.

73
00:02:39,279 --> 00:02:41,681
The first photo shows them as a baby.

74
00:02:41,681 --> 00:02:42,982
- We can look at it and...
- Guess who?

75
00:02:42,982 --> 00:02:45,151
Yes, guess who it is.

76
00:02:45,151 --> 00:02:46,352
So the order is random.

77
00:02:46,352 --> 00:02:47,420
One random album at a time?

78
00:02:47,420 --> 00:02:48,855
Should we open the one on top?

79
00:02:48,855 --> 00:02:50,890
- Yes, that sounds good.
- Let's go in order.

80
00:02:50,890 --> 00:02:52,091
What a little princess.

81
00:02:52,091 --> 00:02:53,593
It's a girl.

82
00:02:54,427 --> 00:02:57,197
(A little princess in the first album)

83
00:02:57,197 --> 00:02:58,798
Isn't this Ro Bin?

84
00:02:58,798 --> 00:03:00,333
What? Me?

85
00:03:01,267 --> 00:03:02,702
I think it's Ye Ji.

86
00:03:02,702 --> 00:03:03,603
Wait.

87
00:03:03,603 --> 00:03:05,572
- It's Min Young.
- Isn't it Ro Bin?

88
00:03:06,372 --> 00:03:07,974
I think it's Min Young.

89
00:03:08,675 --> 00:03:09,809
Maybe Jong...

90
00:03:09,809 --> 00:03:12,512
- Maybe Jong Eun.
- Why me?

91
00:03:12,512 --> 00:03:14,080
I'm a man.

92
00:03:14,714 --> 00:03:16,282
I think it's Ro Bin.

93
00:03:16,282 --> 00:03:17,183
Me?

94
00:03:17,183 --> 00:03:18,918
(Everyone's name comes up.)

95
00:03:18,918 --> 00:03:20,520
No, I think it's Min Young.

96
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:22,722
Let's keep looking for now.

97
00:03:22,722 --> 00:03:24,357
Tell me. Should I turn the page?

98
00:03:24,357 --> 00:03:25,325
Yes.

99
00:03:25,325 --> 00:03:26,326
What's this?

100
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:28,761
It's Ro Bin.

101
00:03:36,903 --> 00:03:39,405
Look at that round little mouth.

102
00:03:39,405 --> 00:03:41,474
She already has her bottom teeth.

103
00:03:41,474 --> 00:03:42,642
She's showing off all four of them.

104
00:03:43,843 --> 00:03:44,777
So cute.

105
00:03:44,777 --> 00:03:46,846
She's so pretty. I think...

106
00:03:46,846 --> 00:03:47,981
I think it's Ye Ji.

107
00:03:47,981 --> 00:03:48,948
It's Ye Ji.

108
00:03:50,350 --> 00:03:51,918
It's Ye Ji.

109
00:03:51,918 --> 00:03:53,920
- She's so pretty.
- So cute.

110
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:55,054
(The first album belongs to Ye Ji.)

111
00:03:55,555 --> 00:03:57,891
(Focused)

112
00:03:59,792 --> 00:04:00,693
Stop it.

113
00:04:00,693 --> 00:04:01,694
Okay.

114
00:04:02,729 --> 00:04:04,697
What's this?

115
00:04:04,697 --> 00:04:06,032
She suddenly has distinct features.

116
00:04:06,032 --> 00:04:07,100
(Shy)

117
00:04:07,100 --> 00:04:07,901
She's so pretty.

118
00:04:07,901 --> 00:04:10,169
That photo on the bottom right...

119
00:04:10,169 --> 00:04:11,237
is so cute.

120
00:04:12,171 --> 00:04:14,574
(Past childhood photos
of her look-alike brother)

121
00:04:14,574 --> 00:04:15,942
You look like your brother.

122
00:04:16,776 --> 00:04:18,578
(Peace sign)

123
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:23,149
(Ye Ji is all grown up.)

124
00:04:23,149 --> 00:04:24,617
She just keeps getting prettier.

125
00:04:26,052 --> 00:04:27,053
My gosh.

126
00:04:27,053 --> 00:04:29,822
- That's a great photo.
- It is.

127
00:04:29,822 --> 00:04:31,191
Show us.

128
00:04:32,292 --> 00:04:36,229
(Ye Ji is first
to reveal her age and job.)

129
00:04:36,596 --> 00:04:38,031
I can't believe I'm first.

130
00:04:38,031 --> 00:04:39,199
All right, let's hear it.

131
00:04:39,199 --> 00:04:40,400
Should I go first?

132
00:04:42,035 --> 00:04:43,303
It's a random order.

133
00:04:43,303 --> 00:04:45,471
I was born in 1998.

134
00:04:46,472 --> 00:04:49,209
I'm an in-house corporate announcer...

135
00:04:49,209 --> 00:04:50,710
I knew it.

136
00:04:50,710 --> 00:04:52,345
and a traffic reporter.

137
00:04:52,345 --> 00:04:53,379
No way.

138
00:04:53,379 --> 00:04:54,714
(Startled)

139
00:04:55,949 --> 00:04:57,717
Traffic on our beltway...

140
00:04:57,717 --> 00:05:00,119
is moving smoothly overall.

141
00:05:00,119 --> 00:05:02,488
Landscaping work is underway
in the first lane...

142
00:05:02,488 --> 00:05:05,758
past the stadium intersection.

143
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,962
At a company,

144
00:05:08,962 --> 00:05:12,498
I deliver news as an in-house announcer.

145
00:05:12,498 --> 00:05:13,333
And...

146
00:05:13,333 --> 00:05:15,735
I also work as a traffic reporter.

147
00:05:16,069 --> 00:05:18,838
I give live traffic updates,

148
00:05:18,838 --> 00:05:21,507
which gives me a great sense of pride.

149
00:05:21,507 --> 00:05:24,644
I also really enjoy broadcasting itself.

150
00:05:25,578 --> 00:05:26,446
(Surprised)

151
00:05:26,679 --> 00:05:27,680
Cool.

152
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,182
I think I've heard this voice before.

153
00:05:29,182 --> 00:05:31,317
- Don't we hear it all the time?
- Right.

154
00:05:31,317 --> 00:05:32,118
That's incredible.

155
00:05:32,118 --> 00:05:33,786
She's amazing.

156
00:05:33,786 --> 00:05:36,189
Seon Ho can't hide his expression.

157
00:05:39,692 --> 00:05:40,994
- Unbelievable.
- I knew it.

158
00:05:40,994 --> 00:05:42,896
I knew it when you read your diary.

159
00:05:42,896 --> 00:05:45,365
- Even the way you project...
- Really?

160
00:05:45,365 --> 00:05:46,299
When...

161
00:05:46,299 --> 00:05:49,068
I was younger,
I didn't enjoy presentations.

162
00:05:49,068 --> 00:05:51,905
I didn't like speaking before a crowd.

163
00:05:51,905 --> 00:05:55,441
But I wanted to challenge myself...

164
00:05:55,441 --> 00:05:58,611
in areas that scared me
and made me feel limited.

165
00:05:58,611 --> 00:05:59,779
Honestly, before I got sick,

166
00:05:59,779 --> 00:06:02,448
being an announcer...

167
00:06:02,448 --> 00:06:06,244
was something I'd considered,
but it scared me.

168
00:06:06,245 --> 00:06:08,788
I didn't think I could do it.

169
00:06:08,788 --> 00:06:12,258
So I never dared to try.

170
00:06:12,258 --> 00:06:17,030
But after I got sick, I began to feel...

171
00:06:17,030 --> 00:06:19,899
that life might be shorter than I thought.

172
00:06:19,899 --> 00:06:21,634
So I decided to do everything I wanted.

173
00:06:21,935 --> 00:06:24,070
Everything I wanted before I died.

174
00:06:24,070 --> 00:06:26,639
That thought suddenly came to me,

175
00:06:26,639 --> 00:06:29,209
so I decided to become an announcer.

176
00:06:32,545 --> 00:06:33,379
That's incredible.

177
00:06:33,379 --> 00:06:35,348
You're amazing.

178
00:06:35,882 --> 00:06:39,519
(After a long illness,
Ye Ji made her dream come true.)

179
00:06:40,987 --> 00:06:42,555
(Glances)

180
00:06:47,393 --> 00:06:48,862
Actually,

181
00:06:48,862 --> 00:06:50,463
Ye Ji and I are mutual blog followers.

182
00:06:51,097 --> 00:06:52,065
Really?

183
00:06:52,065 --> 00:06:54,400
We used to leave encouraging comments.

184
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:55,268
Really?

185
00:06:55,268 --> 00:06:56,603
I already knew.

186
00:06:56,603 --> 00:06:57,770
From the moment you first saw her?

187
00:06:58,371 --> 00:06:59,305
But...

188
00:06:59,305 --> 00:07:01,007
we'd never...

189
00:07:01,007 --> 00:07:02,909
met in person before.

190
00:07:02,909 --> 00:07:04,344
(Everyone learns about
Ye Ji and Seon Ho's connection.)

191
00:07:04,344 --> 00:07:07,280
I was exhausted and overwhelmed
on the first day,

192
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:08,014
(Unbelievable)

193
00:07:08,014 --> 00:07:09,015
so it didn't register.

194
00:07:12,151 --> 00:07:13,419
He just announced it.

195
00:07:13,419 --> 00:07:14,520
Min Young doesn't look happy.

196
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:15,922
Not at all.

197
00:07:15,922 --> 00:07:17,557
When he says something like that,

198
00:07:17,557 --> 00:07:19,058
someone like Min Young,

199
00:07:19,058 --> 00:07:21,361
who's interested in Seon Ho,

200
00:07:21,361 --> 00:07:24,030
might think, "I can't compete with that."

201
00:07:24,030 --> 00:07:26,900
- That's what she may think.
- Right.

202
00:07:26,900 --> 00:07:28,101
That's right.

203
00:07:28,101 --> 00:07:30,403
Did he say it without realizing that?

204
00:07:30,403 --> 00:07:31,504
Maybe.

205
00:07:32,805 --> 00:07:34,974
Some of these photos are on your blog.

206
00:07:34,974 --> 00:07:38,144
Yes, quite a few of them are.

207
00:07:38,411 --> 00:07:39,946
They looked so familiar.

208
00:07:39,946 --> 00:07:40,914
This is incredible.

209
00:07:40,914 --> 00:07:42,248
Was it six years ago?

210
00:07:42,248 --> 00:07:46,052
We became mutual followers
six or seven years ago...

211
00:07:46,052 --> 00:07:48,721
and exchanged comments.

212
00:07:48,721 --> 00:07:52,792
I thought Seon Ho's face looked familiar.

213
00:07:52,792 --> 00:07:55,428
I felt like I'd seen him somewhere.

214
00:07:55,428 --> 00:07:57,664
I still don't know...

215
00:07:57,664 --> 00:07:58,965
what we wrote in those comments,

216
00:07:58,965 --> 00:08:01,000
so once we leave the House...

217
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:02,168
You can check.

218
00:08:02,168 --> 00:08:03,269
I'll see what we said to each other.

219
00:08:03,269 --> 00:08:04,370
That'll be so much fun.

220
00:08:04,370 --> 00:08:05,205
Right.

221
00:08:05,205 --> 00:08:07,440
I was stunned when I found out.

222
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:09,809
It's like searching for
a six-year-old memory you forgot.

223
00:08:11,110 --> 00:08:12,111
That's fascinating.

224
00:08:13,746 --> 00:08:15,014
(Ye Ji's turn ends.)

225
00:08:15,014 --> 00:08:15,882
- That was amazing.
- Thank you.

226
00:08:15,882 --> 00:08:16,983
It suits your image too.

227
00:08:17,517 --> 00:08:20,253
(The second album appears.)

228
00:08:21,788 --> 00:08:23,389
That's Na Young.

229
00:08:23,389 --> 00:08:24,457
It's Na Young.

230
00:08:24,457 --> 00:08:25,525
It's Na Young.

231
00:08:27,044 --> 00:08:29,996
(Na Young's distinct features
give her away instantly.)

232
00:08:29,996 --> 00:08:31,431
She can't hide her expression.

233
00:08:31,431 --> 00:08:33,166
Come on out.

234
00:08:33,166 --> 00:08:34,434
Come on.

235
00:08:34,434 --> 00:08:35,768
What? Why?

236
00:08:35,768 --> 00:08:37,437
It doesn't look like me.

237
00:08:38,438 --> 00:08:40,807
- How do you look exactly the same?
- Really?

238
00:08:40,807 --> 00:08:42,709
Your features are so strong.

239
00:08:43,843 --> 00:08:45,511
Even the expression is the same.

240
00:08:49,415 --> 00:08:52,518
(Cheers erupt with each new page.)

241
00:08:53,920 --> 00:08:55,021
(Shy)

242
00:08:55,021 --> 00:08:58,791
Even those bangs and the photo colors.

243
00:08:58,791 --> 00:09:00,560
It's pure Cyworld aesthetic.

244
00:09:01,294 --> 00:09:03,062
She's so pretty, though.

245
00:09:03,062 --> 00:09:05,231
Long hair really suits you too.

246
00:09:05,231 --> 00:09:06,032
Exactly.

247
00:09:06,933 --> 00:09:08,701
That's such a good photo.

248
00:09:12,005 --> 00:09:14,007
It's so well taken.

249
00:09:14,007 --> 00:09:15,441
I should've taken photos like that.

250
00:09:15,942 --> 00:09:19,012
I tried every possible pose.

251
00:09:19,345 --> 00:09:21,581
The long-awaited career reveal.

252
00:09:21,581 --> 00:09:23,383
- Her age and job.
- I'm curious.

253
00:09:23,383 --> 00:09:25,785
I want to know. Guess my age.

254
00:09:25,785 --> 00:09:27,887
- Maybe 29 or 30?
- Around my age.

255
00:09:27,887 --> 00:09:28,721
Born in early 1998.

256
00:09:28,721 --> 00:09:31,524
I think you were born in 2000,

257
00:09:31,524 --> 00:09:33,593
or in 1998 like Ye Ji.

258
00:09:33,826 --> 00:09:35,195
Maybe early 1998.

259
00:09:35,195 --> 00:09:36,296
I was...

260
00:09:36,763 --> 00:09:38,531
born in January 1994.

261
00:09:39,499 --> 00:09:41,201
(Startled)

262
00:09:41,201 --> 00:09:43,536
I have several jobs.

263
00:09:43,870 --> 00:09:46,773
My main job is acting.

264
00:09:48,041 --> 00:09:49,008
And...

265
00:09:53,947 --> 00:09:56,416
I love acting...

266
00:09:56,416 --> 00:09:57,884
because I get to become
different people...

267
00:09:57,884 --> 00:09:59,285
and try different professions.

268
00:09:59,852 --> 00:10:03,389
That's what makes it so appealing to me.

269
00:10:05,291 --> 00:10:09,429
I also teach and translate Chinese.

270
00:10:10,129 --> 00:10:13,733
Through acting and teaching,

271
00:10:13,733 --> 00:10:17,270
I love feeling connected to other people.

272
00:10:19,005 --> 00:10:21,875
Both are meaningful to me.

273
00:10:24,177 --> 00:10:25,378
That's amazing.

274
00:10:25,378 --> 00:10:26,412
Exactly.

275
00:10:26,412 --> 00:10:27,947
But with all that...

276
00:10:27,947 --> 00:10:31,985
talent, getting sick must've been so hard.

277
00:10:31,985 --> 00:10:34,020
What's incredible...

278
00:10:34,020 --> 00:10:36,923
is I passed an audition
just as I got sick.

279
00:10:36,923 --> 00:10:39,559
So I stopped my treatment.

280
00:10:39,559 --> 00:10:40,627
I couldn't afford to swell up.

281
00:10:41,961 --> 00:10:45,565
I'd just been diagnosed with a brain tumor
and started medication...

282
00:10:45,565 --> 00:10:46,733
when I got the call that I'd passed.

283
00:10:47,634 --> 00:10:50,403
I told my doctor the truth right away.

284
00:10:50,403 --> 00:10:53,540
I had to film, so the swelling had to go.

285
00:10:53,540 --> 00:10:57,443
That's when I passed the audition.

286
00:10:57,443 --> 00:11:00,480
It was overwhelming.

287
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:03,249
My hearing was gradually fading,

288
00:11:03,249 --> 00:11:08,321
so we tried steroids to save it.

289
00:11:08,321 --> 00:11:11,257
But because the dose was so high,

290
00:11:11,257 --> 00:11:14,260
I gained over 15 kilograms.

291
00:11:14,861 --> 00:11:18,998
I practically begged my doctor.

292
00:11:18,998 --> 00:11:23,670
I had to make an unavoidable choice.

293
00:11:25,939 --> 00:11:28,441
I said I would stop the steroids.

294
00:11:28,441 --> 00:11:30,944
That's when I gave up my hearing.

295
00:11:31,744 --> 00:11:37,450
(A moment when her dream
forced her to make a sacrifice)

296
00:11:39,819 --> 00:11:43,122
(Next comes the third album.)

297
00:11:43,990 --> 00:11:45,491
- How cute.
- Who is it?

298
00:11:46,259 --> 00:11:49,195
This one's really hard to guess.

299
00:11:49,195 --> 00:11:51,998
(This photo is hard to identify.)

300
00:11:53,566 --> 00:11:54,534
Wait.

301
00:11:55,134 --> 00:11:56,236
Isn't it Seon Ho?

302
00:11:57,437 --> 00:11:58,705
It is Seon Ho.

303
00:11:58,705 --> 00:12:00,940
Those are Seon Ho's eyes.

304
00:12:01,708 --> 00:12:05,378
(Baby Seon Ho's bright, sparkling eyes)

305
00:12:05,378 --> 00:12:07,680
Look how cute he is on that sled.

306
00:12:08,681 --> 00:12:10,984
Those are socks. I didn't have gloves.

307
00:12:11,551 --> 00:12:13,853
(Sock mittens)

308
00:12:15,088 --> 00:12:19,158
(Seon Ho at his high school graduation)

309
00:12:19,158 --> 00:12:21,094
He was a school heartthrob.

310
00:12:21,094 --> 00:12:22,595
He must've been so popular.

311
00:12:23,029 --> 00:12:25,098
(Focused)

312
00:12:26,799 --> 00:12:28,201
My goodness.

313
00:12:28,201 --> 00:12:29,602
Why does that uniform suit you so well?

314
00:12:29,602 --> 00:12:30,570
What's this?

315
00:12:31,504 --> 00:12:34,173
Look at that expression. He's a natural.

316
00:12:40,613 --> 00:12:43,116
He's so handsome.

317
00:12:43,116 --> 00:12:44,484
All of a sudden...

318
00:12:45,084 --> 00:12:46,286
What happened all of a sudden?

319
00:12:48,454 --> 00:12:49,522
He's so handsome.

320
00:12:49,522 --> 00:12:51,257
That's an amazing photo.

321
00:12:51,891 --> 00:12:53,893
I'm proud of my roommate.

322
00:12:53,893 --> 00:12:54,994
So handsome.

323
00:12:57,764 --> 00:12:58,965
All right.

324
00:12:58,965 --> 00:13:00,433
Maybe 1998? 1997?

325
00:13:00,433 --> 00:13:02,235
You think so? Any other guesses?

326
00:13:02,235 --> 00:13:03,336
- Maybe 2000.
- Really?

327
00:13:03,803 --> 00:13:05,171
Or 1999.

328
00:13:05,171 --> 00:13:06,906
- I say 2001.
- 2001?

329
00:13:08,775 --> 00:13:09,809
Me too.

330
00:13:11,878 --> 00:13:14,647
- I was born in 1999.
- I knew it.

331
00:13:17,483 --> 00:13:19,452
I am currently...

332
00:13:19,452 --> 00:13:21,854
- preparing to become a firefighter.
- A firefighter.

333
00:13:22,622 --> 00:13:23,623
That suits you.

334
00:13:25,491 --> 00:13:26,759
Did you take the exam this year?

335
00:13:26,759 --> 00:13:28,428
I started preparing this year.

336
00:13:28,728 --> 00:13:31,331
I prepared for it in the past too.

337
00:13:34,067 --> 00:13:35,201
(Introduction to Fire Science)

338
00:13:35,768 --> 00:13:39,739
Now I'm studying for the firefighter exam.

339
00:13:42,342 --> 00:13:46,279
I once suffered from a serious illness.

340
00:13:46,279 --> 00:13:49,649
I saw the people around me...

341
00:13:49,649 --> 00:13:51,517
who took care of me...

342
00:13:51,517 --> 00:13:53,286
and the medical staff,

343
00:13:53,286 --> 00:13:55,388
and I wanted to become like them.

344
00:13:55,388 --> 00:13:56,756
I think that's when it started.

345
00:14:00,860 --> 00:14:04,163
Rather than doing just any job,

346
00:14:04,163 --> 00:14:05,832
I want to live a meaningful life.

347
00:14:06,533 --> 00:14:08,635
It makes me feel more passionate.

348
00:14:09,369 --> 00:14:12,639
I'm moving a bit slowly toward my dream,

349
00:14:12,639 --> 00:14:15,875
but I feel I'm steadily moving forward.

350
00:14:15,875 --> 00:14:17,076
- That's amazing.
- You can do it.

351
00:14:17,544 --> 00:14:19,345
- You're not slow at all.
- Exactly.

352
00:14:22,715 --> 00:14:25,785
(Who owns the fourth album?)

353
00:14:31,491 --> 00:14:35,728
(A little boy holding a corn dog)

354
00:14:35,728 --> 00:14:37,297
He's already tall.

355
00:14:38,932 --> 00:14:40,300
He's tall from the very first photo.

356
00:14:40,300 --> 00:14:42,802
Do Gon! That's you, right?

357
00:14:43,236 --> 00:14:45,071
(His lanky build gives him away.)

358
00:14:45,071 --> 00:14:46,172
Right?

359
00:14:46,172 --> 00:14:49,142
(The fourth album belongs to Do Gon.)

360
00:14:49,142 --> 00:14:50,143
He's so...

361
00:14:50,143 --> 00:14:51,144
So tall.

362
00:14:51,144 --> 00:14:53,813
His proportions are unreal.

363
00:15:02,689 --> 00:15:04,190
How is a baby so tall?

364
00:15:04,190 --> 00:15:05,592
Why are his legs so long?

365
00:15:07,160 --> 00:15:08,194
What?

366
00:15:08,194 --> 00:15:09,095
What?

367
00:15:09,095 --> 00:15:10,563
Why is your sister so tall?

368
00:15:10,563 --> 00:15:11,698
Wait.

369
00:15:11,698 --> 00:15:13,600
Why is she so tall?

370
00:15:13,600 --> 00:15:15,435
How tall is your sister?

371
00:15:15,435 --> 00:15:17,070
About 168 cm.

372
00:15:17,070 --> 00:15:18,838
She's tall too.

373
00:15:18,838 --> 00:15:22,141
(The siblings had remarkable builds
even when they were young.)

374
00:15:22,976 --> 00:15:24,744
That's a great photo.

375
00:15:24,744 --> 00:15:25,612
What's with all of you?

376
00:15:25,612 --> 00:15:26,679
That's an amazing photo.

377
00:15:30,650 --> 00:15:31,918
He's so handsome.

378
00:15:31,918 --> 00:15:34,587
I really like that last photo.

379
00:15:34,587 --> 00:15:35,521
It's a great shot.

380
00:15:35,521 --> 00:15:36,823
That's incredible.

381
00:15:37,657 --> 00:15:38,958
I'm so curious about your age.

382
00:15:38,958 --> 00:15:40,660
Me too.

383
00:15:43,830 --> 00:15:45,532
Do Gon's age is...

384
00:15:45,532 --> 00:15:46,633
Important.

385
00:15:46,633 --> 00:15:48,067
I want to know.

386
00:15:48,067 --> 00:15:51,204
Ro Bin said an age gap of about four...

387
00:15:51,204 --> 00:15:52,472
was okay.

388
00:15:53,239 --> 00:15:55,308
Maybe 1993...

389
00:15:55,308 --> 00:15:57,510
or 1992, 1991. That's my guess.

390
00:15:57,510 --> 00:15:58,811
I think it's around there.

391
00:15:58,811 --> 00:16:01,247
The background looks familiar.

392
00:16:01,247 --> 00:16:03,116
The picture quality dates it too.

393
00:16:03,116 --> 00:16:04,250
What's familiar about the background?

394
00:16:04,250 --> 00:16:06,386
The colors?

395
00:16:06,386 --> 00:16:08,254
My family had that too.

396
00:16:09,322 --> 00:16:10,190
You're right.

397
00:16:10,190 --> 00:16:11,324
He's one of us.

398
00:16:11,324 --> 00:16:12,892
"One of us."

399
00:16:12,892 --> 00:16:14,527
Even the curtains.

400
00:16:14,527 --> 00:16:15,695
Those curtains are from our time.

401
00:16:15,695 --> 00:16:16,863
We had them at home too.

402
00:16:18,198 --> 00:16:21,734
(How old is Do Gon,
who seems to be one of them?)

403
00:16:21,734 --> 00:16:22,735
I was born...

404
00:16:23,703 --> 00:16:24,637
in 1991.

405
00:16:24,637 --> 00:16:26,005
If you were born in 1991...

406
00:16:26,005 --> 00:16:28,007
If you were born in 1991,
how old does that make you?

407
00:16:28,007 --> 00:16:29,742
You're 36.

408
00:16:29,742 --> 00:16:30,510
Thirty-six.

409
00:16:30,510 --> 00:16:32,445
Yes, I'm 36.

410
00:16:33,546 --> 00:16:35,615
I expected it, but hearing it...

411
00:16:36,249 --> 00:16:37,217
was still...

412
00:16:38,551 --> 00:16:40,420
Well...

413
00:16:40,420 --> 00:16:42,655
I thought, "What do I do?"

414
00:16:43,756 --> 00:16:46,926
I don't know why that number bothers me.

415
00:16:57,203 --> 00:16:58,938
- I have no idea what his job is.
- Me neither.

416
00:17:00,740 --> 00:17:01,441
What do you do?

417
00:17:01,441 --> 00:17:03,109
First of all,

418
00:17:03,943 --> 00:17:04,878
cafés.

419
00:17:05,411 --> 00:17:06,412
What about cafés?

420
00:17:06,412 --> 00:17:07,547
You like them, and?

421
00:17:08,615 --> 00:17:10,950
I've always loved coffee,

422
00:17:10,950 --> 00:17:13,887
so I consult for cafés.

423
00:17:13,887 --> 00:17:14,921
Cool.

424
00:17:14,921 --> 00:17:15,855
That's incredible.

425
00:17:16,556 --> 00:17:18,424
That coffee gear makes sense now.

426
00:17:18,424 --> 00:17:19,492
Exactly.

427
00:17:27,200 --> 00:17:30,236
I've worked in coffee for a long time.

428
00:17:30,236 --> 00:17:33,907
I draw on that experience to consult on...

429
00:17:33,907 --> 00:17:36,142
interiors and menu development.

430
00:17:36,142 --> 00:17:38,811
I handle all of those areas,

431
00:17:38,811 --> 00:17:40,847
and build the entire system for them.

432
00:17:46,519 --> 00:17:48,054
Alongside my café work,

433
00:17:48,388 --> 00:17:50,957
I also model when jobs come in.

434
00:17:52,692 --> 00:17:55,929
I happened to start modeling at 20.

435
00:17:56,930 --> 00:18:00,099
(Do Gon modeled before his illness.)

436
00:18:01,134 --> 00:18:03,303
I mainly shot ads,

437
00:18:03,303 --> 00:18:05,405
wedding campaigns,

438
00:18:05,405 --> 00:18:07,307
and lookbooks.

439
00:18:07,974 --> 00:18:10,109
I do that alongside my coffee work.

440
00:18:10,109 --> 00:18:12,612
I make a living doing everything I can.

441
00:18:14,380 --> 00:18:15,381
Next.

442
00:18:17,283 --> 00:18:19,252
Who owns the yellow album?

443
00:18:19,252 --> 00:18:20,153
I'm curious.

444
00:18:23,189 --> 00:18:24,123
Who could it be?

445
00:18:24,123 --> 00:18:27,927
(Who is this child
with the adorable chubby cheeks?)

446
00:18:27,927 --> 00:18:29,596
No.

447
00:18:29,596 --> 00:18:30,330
Wait.

448
00:18:30,330 --> 00:18:31,264
This is so cute.

449
00:18:31,264 --> 00:18:32,465
Isn't that Ro Bin?

450
00:18:32,465 --> 00:18:33,566
It's Ro Bin.

451
00:18:33,566 --> 00:18:34,534
There are three girls.

452
00:18:34,534 --> 00:18:35,969
It's Ro Bin.

453
00:18:35,969 --> 00:18:37,237
Yes, that's me.

454
00:18:40,473 --> 00:18:44,711
(Ro Bin, the youngest of three sisters)

455
00:18:46,412 --> 00:18:47,480
So cute.

456
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:50,216
That photo on the left is adorable.

457
00:18:51,017 --> 00:18:52,952
- She's inside a rice cooker.
- She is.

458
00:18:56,556 --> 00:18:59,058
- She's so pretty.
- How adorable.

459
00:18:59,058 --> 00:19:00,026
So pretty.

460
00:19:04,898 --> 00:19:05,765
So cute.

461
00:19:05,765 --> 00:19:07,767
You did taekwondo.

462
00:19:07,767 --> 00:19:09,202
Is that your victory meal?

463
00:19:09,202 --> 00:19:11,638
Yes, it is.

464
00:19:12,972 --> 00:19:17,076
(A celebratory feast after passing)

465
00:19:18,778 --> 00:19:20,046
That's so cute.

466
00:19:21,147 --> 00:19:22,682
Close it already.

467
00:19:22,682 --> 00:19:24,150
It's a good picture.

468
00:19:24,150 --> 00:19:25,585
I seriously don't get it.

469
00:19:25,585 --> 00:19:27,053
Everyone's photos look great.
Why the fuss?

470
00:19:27,053 --> 00:19:27,854
Wait until it's your turn.

471
00:19:28,588 --> 00:19:29,923
This is hilarious.

472
00:19:32,091 --> 00:19:33,960
I pose like this a lot.

473
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:34,928
Like this?

474
00:19:34,928 --> 00:19:35,929
Every time I take a picture.

475
00:19:36,596 --> 00:19:42,735
(Spirited and cute,
Ro Bin's signature pose)

476
00:19:42,735 --> 00:19:44,204
Guess my age.

477
00:19:45,138 --> 00:19:47,740
I vote for 2001.

478
00:19:47,740 --> 00:19:48,441
Really?

479
00:19:48,441 --> 00:19:49,876
Me too. Either 2001 or 2000.

480
00:19:53,112 --> 00:19:55,415
When Ro Bin and I...

481
00:19:56,249 --> 00:19:59,185
talked on our date today,

482
00:19:59,185 --> 00:20:02,855
we discussed what age gaps were okay.

483
00:20:04,090 --> 00:20:05,258
Even if he's older,

484
00:20:05,258 --> 00:20:07,560
I'd prefer the age gap not to feel big.

485
00:20:07,560 --> 00:20:08,895
I see.

486
00:20:10,263 --> 00:20:12,999
- Up to four years is okay.
- Four years?

487
00:20:13,900 --> 00:20:19,772
Ro Bin had said four years,

488
00:20:19,772 --> 00:20:22,642
and that conversation came back to me.

489
00:20:25,778 --> 00:20:26,813
Can I tell you now?

490
00:20:26,813 --> 00:20:28,915
I was born in 2000. I'm 27.

491
00:20:29,949 --> 00:20:30,650
(Surprised)

492
00:20:30,650 --> 00:20:31,751
Wait.

493
00:20:31,751 --> 00:20:33,753
They're nine years apart.

494
00:20:33,753 --> 00:20:35,221
From Do Gon's perspective,

495
00:20:35,221 --> 00:20:36,990
pursuing her so directly...

496
00:20:36,990 --> 00:20:38,291
could feel like too much.

497
00:20:38,291 --> 00:20:40,026
It could feel like too much,

498
00:20:40,026 --> 00:20:43,563
and even to him, the gap may feel
much bigger than he expected.

499
00:20:44,464 --> 00:20:46,900
This is causing a huge ripple effect.

500
00:20:46,900 --> 00:20:48,835
Everything is shifting.

501
00:20:48,835 --> 00:20:49,702
Goodness.

502
00:20:52,505 --> 00:20:55,475
I expected a certain age gap,

503
00:20:55,475 --> 00:20:58,211
but it was much bigger than I thought.

504
00:20:59,145 --> 00:21:02,282
That really shocked me.

505
00:21:02,649 --> 00:21:05,485
I also remembered my talk with Ro Bin.

506
00:21:06,853 --> 00:21:10,089
So a lot went through my mind then.

507
00:21:12,992 --> 00:21:16,062
I'm not currently working.

508
00:21:16,062 --> 00:21:19,132
I'm not a student either.

509
00:21:19,132 --> 00:21:20,300
I'm looking for a job.

510
00:21:21,100 --> 00:21:21,935
Really?

511
00:21:21,935 --> 00:21:24,737
I came here while preparing,

512
00:21:24,737 --> 00:21:26,940
and I'm looking at the food industry.

513
00:21:26,940 --> 00:21:29,542
There's one company I really want to join,

514
00:21:29,542 --> 00:21:32,011
so I'm preparing to apply there.

515
00:21:39,953 --> 00:21:43,389
(Since her illness,she's steadily
building toward her dream.)

516
00:21:46,292 --> 00:21:49,462
I'm currently interested in food,

517
00:21:49,462 --> 00:21:51,831
so I'm preparing for food marketing jobs.

518
00:21:54,100 --> 00:21:57,937
After I got sick,
I completely changed my diet.

519
00:21:59,239 --> 00:22:02,141
That got me really interested in food.

520
00:22:04,711 --> 00:22:08,581
As I saw how food affects people,

521
00:22:08,581 --> 00:22:11,417
I got more interested in food marketing.

522
00:22:13,720 --> 00:22:15,989
I've also practiced food photography.

523
00:22:17,690 --> 00:22:18,691
That's amazing.

524
00:22:18,691 --> 00:22:20,693
I'm trying to cook more these days too,

525
00:22:20,693 --> 00:22:22,595
but cooking is really hard.

526
00:22:23,429 --> 00:22:26,065
Just take it step by step.

527
00:22:26,065 --> 00:22:27,300
Right.

528
00:22:27,300 --> 00:22:28,701
She's so young.

529
00:22:28,701 --> 00:22:29,569
You can do it.

530
00:22:29,569 --> 00:22:30,470
I can do it.

531
00:22:31,538 --> 00:22:32,939
(Who owns the next album?)

532
00:22:32,939 --> 00:22:33,840
I'm curious.

533
00:22:35,308 --> 00:22:36,910
He looks exactly the same as he does now.

534
00:22:36,910 --> 00:22:39,479
Exactly the same. So cute.

535
00:22:39,479 --> 00:22:40,380
(One person is especially embarrassed.)

536
00:22:40,880 --> 00:22:44,751
(Baby Jong Eun looks just like him now.)

537
00:22:46,286 --> 00:22:47,820
He's a baby potato.

538
00:22:47,820 --> 00:22:50,123
- A real baby potato.
- The potato's here.

539
00:22:50,123 --> 00:22:51,658
A little potato.

540
00:22:53,326 --> 00:22:54,594
When Jong Eun first appeared,

541
00:22:54,594 --> 00:22:56,396
I thought he'd be the tough one.

542
00:22:56,396 --> 00:22:57,597
He's the gentlest.

543
00:22:58,164 --> 00:22:59,232
And the cutest.

544
00:23:02,302 --> 00:23:04,437
How does he look exactly the same now?

545
00:23:04,437 --> 00:23:06,272
He hasn't changed at all.

546
00:23:07,574 --> 00:23:08,875
He's just a miniature version of himself.

547
00:23:13,046 --> 00:23:14,681
That's so cute.

548
00:23:14,681 --> 00:23:15,915
What's with those sunglasses?

549
00:23:15,915 --> 00:23:17,317
He looks exactly the same.

550
00:23:17,317 --> 00:23:18,851
He really does.

551
00:23:18,851 --> 00:23:20,720
(Focused)

552
00:23:24,891 --> 00:23:26,292
He looks like a potato.

553
00:23:27,560 --> 00:23:28,461
So cute.

554
00:23:31,898 --> 00:23:33,132
(Laughs)

555
00:23:33,132 --> 00:23:35,134
She's rejecting it.

556
00:23:35,134 --> 00:23:36,836
Why are you rejecting it?

557
00:23:36,836 --> 00:23:37,871
"He looks like a potato,"
and she did this.

558
00:23:37,871 --> 00:23:38,905
So cold.

559
00:23:39,472 --> 00:23:40,607
(Min Young is strict
about who counts as a potato.)

560
00:23:40,607 --> 00:23:41,875
She won't say a word.

561
00:23:41,875 --> 00:23:42,775
He looks the most like a potato.

562
00:23:42,775 --> 00:23:45,178
The potato's right here, Min Young.

563
00:23:49,382 --> 00:23:50,783
(Startled)

564
00:23:50,783 --> 00:23:52,118
Everyone...

565
00:23:52,385 --> 00:23:53,753
looks like they took actor headshots.

566
00:23:53,753 --> 00:23:55,121
What's with all of you?

567
00:23:55,121 --> 00:23:56,923
That's a great photo.

568
00:23:56,923 --> 00:23:58,391
That's incredible.

569
00:23:58,391 --> 00:23:59,592
He's so handsome.

570
00:23:59,592 --> 00:24:00,627
This is intimidating.

571
00:24:01,261 --> 00:24:03,963
It makes me so curious about his job.

572
00:24:03,963 --> 00:24:04,864
Exactly.

573
00:24:05,665 --> 00:24:06,866
Which first? Your age?

574
00:24:07,634 --> 00:24:08,501
Your age first.

575
00:24:08,501 --> 00:24:09,369
I think 1996.

576
00:24:10,637 --> 00:24:11,638
I was...

577
00:24:12,305 --> 00:24:13,473
born in early 1998.

578
00:24:13,940 --> 00:24:15,308
What does early 1998 mean?

579
00:24:15,308 --> 00:24:17,410
That makes you my age.

580
00:24:17,410 --> 00:24:19,879
My friends were born in 1997.

581
00:24:19,879 --> 00:24:21,648
You two are the same age.

582
00:24:30,857 --> 00:24:32,559
- Your job.
- I'm so curious about it.

583
00:24:32,559 --> 00:24:33,459
My first job...

584
00:24:33,459 --> 00:24:36,062
was as an emergency medical technician.

585
00:24:38,298 --> 00:24:40,033
- Cool.
- That suddenly makes you...

586
00:24:40,033 --> 00:24:41,634
seem so different.

587
00:24:41,634 --> 00:24:44,604
I prepared for the firefighter exam
for a year.

588
00:24:45,138 --> 00:24:47,207
After my illness, my lung capacity fell,

589
00:24:47,207 --> 00:24:49,375
and my joints began to stiffen,

590
00:24:49,976 --> 00:24:51,077
so I gave up.

591
00:24:52,612 --> 00:24:55,615
I wondered what related jobs there were,

592
00:24:55,615 --> 00:24:58,017
and what I could do with my major.

593
00:24:58,585 --> 00:24:59,986
After looking around,

594
00:24:59,986 --> 00:25:02,021
I got a job as a safety manager.

595
00:25:02,689 --> 00:25:04,924
But when they found out about my illness,

596
00:25:07,360 --> 00:25:09,863
they forced me to resign.

597
00:25:12,665 --> 00:25:17,971
I thought safety management and
firefighting had things in common,

598
00:25:17,971 --> 00:25:20,707
so I chose this path.

599
00:25:20,707 --> 00:25:24,677
At work, every Tuesday before dawn,

600
00:25:24,677 --> 00:25:27,413
they held a group run.

601
00:25:27,413 --> 00:25:30,683
My lung function was poor,

602
00:25:30,683 --> 00:25:34,654
so I told my manager the truth...

603
00:25:34,654 --> 00:25:38,658
and said I couldn't run.

604
00:25:38,658 --> 00:25:43,396
He said it wouldn't work,
so I had to quit.

605
00:25:43,396 --> 00:25:47,967
All I thought was,
"I'll make them regret losing me."

606
00:25:52,906 --> 00:25:57,076
While everyone else moved ahead,
I was far behind.

607
00:25:58,111 --> 00:26:01,981
I felt I had to catch up quickly.

608
00:26:02,649 --> 00:26:04,884
That drove me to work even harder.

609
00:26:04,884 --> 00:26:06,619
I've kept studying for certifications.

610
00:26:08,721 --> 00:26:11,724
Hazardous materials, industrial safety,

611
00:26:11,724 --> 00:26:13,593
and Level 2 fire safety management...

612
00:26:13,927 --> 00:26:15,562
are all certifications I earned last year.

613
00:26:16,129 --> 00:26:17,630
I think I have about five in total.

614
00:26:18,798 --> 00:26:22,535
I'll keep trying until I succeed.

615
00:26:23,836 --> 00:26:25,104
I really hope he succeeds.

616
00:26:25,104 --> 00:26:27,240
It's amazing
how he keeps challenging himself.

617
00:26:27,240 --> 00:26:30,210
Thinking, "I'll make them regret it,"

618
00:26:30,210 --> 00:26:32,145
that motivated him to work even harder.

619
00:26:32,145 --> 00:26:33,146
I thought that was incredible.

620
00:26:33,146 --> 00:26:35,014
At an age when people are job hunting...

621
00:26:35,014 --> 00:26:37,550
and starting their careers,

622
00:26:37,550 --> 00:26:39,519
he must have gone through so much.

623
00:26:39,519 --> 00:26:41,654
He's so impressive and admirable.

624
00:26:41,654 --> 00:26:42,355
That's amazing.

625
00:26:42,355 --> 00:26:43,590
You'll succeed.

626
00:26:43,590 --> 00:26:44,457
For real.

627
00:26:44,724 --> 00:26:46,392
You're incredible.

628
00:26:46,392 --> 00:26:48,928
I didn't want to hesitate...

629
00:26:48,928 --> 00:26:51,431
or use my illness as an excuse.

630
00:26:54,434 --> 00:26:56,202
When it came to...

631
00:26:56,202 --> 00:26:59,472
what he loved and wanted to do,

632
00:26:59,472 --> 00:27:02,508
he never stopped working toward it.

633
00:27:02,876 --> 00:27:06,613
He keeps studying and trying new things.

634
00:27:06,613 --> 00:27:09,682
That made me even more attracted to him.

635
00:27:12,318 --> 00:27:14,053
There are two people left now.

636
00:27:14,053 --> 00:27:14,854
Two.

637
00:27:14,854 --> 00:27:15,655
Let's see.

638
00:27:16,456 --> 00:27:17,857
It's Min Young.

639
00:27:17,857 --> 00:27:19,459
She's the only woman left.

640
00:27:19,459 --> 00:27:20,560
Right.

641
00:27:20,560 --> 00:27:21,561
It has to be Min Young.

642
00:27:24,797 --> 00:27:28,835
(The seventh album belongs to Min Young.)

643
00:27:28,835 --> 00:27:30,203
Those chubby cheeks are so cute.

644
00:27:30,203 --> 00:27:32,672
It looks like she has food in her mouth.

645
00:27:32,672 --> 00:27:33,740
She's hiding a snack.

646
00:27:36,943 --> 00:27:37,844
So cute.

647
00:27:42,615 --> 00:27:45,451
(Mini Min Young inside a rice cooker)

648
00:27:46,419 --> 00:27:48,955
She's in a rice cooker too.

649
00:27:49,255 --> 00:27:51,491
- You got inside one too?
- I did.

650
00:27:52,325 --> 00:27:53,259
That's incredible.

651
00:27:59,832 --> 00:28:01,668
Her lips are so cute.

652
00:28:01,668 --> 00:28:04,204
Her lips look exactly the same.

653
00:28:06,906 --> 00:28:08,775
- That's a good photo.
- No, it's not.

654
00:28:08,775 --> 00:28:11,144
My cheekbones stick out so much.

655
00:28:11,311 --> 00:28:12,412
Is your left side your good side?

656
00:28:12,412 --> 00:28:13,479
That's exactly right.

657
00:28:14,180 --> 00:28:16,082
(Fellow members of the left-side club)

658
00:28:16,449 --> 00:28:17,850
- That's a great photo.
- So pretty.

659
00:28:17,850 --> 00:28:19,886
- It's a beautiful photo.
- No.

660
00:28:19,886 --> 00:28:21,054
Everyone has such star quality.

661
00:28:21,721 --> 00:28:24,424
I was born in 2003.

662
00:28:24,791 --> 00:28:25,592
(Startled)

663
00:28:25,592 --> 00:28:26,926
You're 24?

664
00:28:26,926 --> 00:28:29,062
Wait, let me calculate.

665
00:28:29,062 --> 00:28:32,665
I run a clothing business.

666
00:28:32,665 --> 00:28:35,668
- An online store?
- A clothing business.

667
00:28:45,044 --> 00:28:46,179
Unbelievable.

668
00:28:46,179 --> 00:28:47,113
Wait.

669
00:28:47,113 --> 00:28:49,082
- She feels like the older one.
- Wait.

670
00:28:49,082 --> 00:28:50,016
Big sis.

671
00:28:50,617 --> 00:28:51,551
She's our big sister.

672
00:28:51,551 --> 00:28:52,986
Did I read the logo wrong?

673
00:28:54,821 --> 00:28:55,788
Wait.

674
00:28:55,788 --> 00:28:56,990
That's incredible.

675
00:28:56,990 --> 00:28:59,792
I thought this segment was made for her.

676
00:29:00,894 --> 00:29:02,061
The job reveal?

677
00:29:02,061 --> 00:29:02,896
She stole the show.

678
00:29:02,896 --> 00:29:04,097
She was the star of the segment.

679
00:29:04,097 --> 00:29:05,465
"I'll come out now."

680
00:29:05,465 --> 00:29:06,833
"It's my turn now."

681
00:29:07,567 --> 00:29:08,768
"I'm next."

682
00:29:08,768 --> 00:29:10,403
"It's my time."

683
00:29:10,403 --> 00:29:11,704
"My time has come."

684
00:29:12,872 --> 00:29:14,641
(Heart flutters)

685
00:29:22,849 --> 00:29:24,817
(Dongdaemun General Market)

686
00:29:25,752 --> 00:29:28,254
(Expertise well beyond her years)

687
00:29:28,254 --> 00:29:31,524
Could I get this
bio-washed striped fabric, please?

688
00:29:32,225 --> 00:29:33,927
I run a clothing business.

689
00:29:34,527 --> 00:29:37,964
I search for fabrics and visit factories.

690
00:29:37,964 --> 00:29:39,465
I deliver the fabric to them...

691
00:29:39,465 --> 00:29:42,035
and review several revised samples.

692
00:29:42,035 --> 00:29:44,971
Once production is complete, I sell them.

693
00:29:44,971 --> 00:29:46,906
(She oversees everything
from planning to sales.)

694
00:29:49,609 --> 00:29:52,111
We'll try it.
If it doesn't work, we'll go with this.

695
00:29:52,111 --> 00:29:54,180
(Min Young, CEO of a clothing brand)

696
00:29:55,381 --> 00:29:57,650
I oversee the design and everything else.

697
00:29:59,452 --> 00:30:01,221
Yes, I own an online store.

698
00:30:01,221 --> 00:30:03,923
I make and sell clothes.

699
00:30:03,923 --> 00:30:06,526
I focus mainly on wardrobe basics.

700
00:30:06,526 --> 00:30:07,961
How are you someone born in 2003?

701
00:30:07,961 --> 00:30:09,028
Exactly.

702
00:30:09,028 --> 00:30:10,864
How is that possible?

703
00:30:10,864 --> 00:30:12,465
I'm the boss.

704
00:30:13,233 --> 00:30:14,534
Boss.

705
00:30:14,534 --> 00:30:15,435
Big sis.

706
00:30:16,236 --> 00:30:17,871
How was she born in 2003?

707
00:30:18,605 --> 00:30:21,941
I was incredibly impressed.

708
00:30:21,941 --> 00:30:25,245
She seemed so passionate,

709
00:30:25,545 --> 00:30:26,646
which surprised me.

710
00:30:27,180 --> 00:30:30,483
I thought she was living an amazing life.

711
00:30:31,417 --> 00:30:34,721
(Min Young reveals an unexpected side.)

712
00:30:35,388 --> 00:30:36,389
Finally.

713
00:30:37,123 --> 00:30:38,057
Let's see.

714
00:30:39,292 --> 00:30:41,361
(Laughs)

715
00:30:44,197 --> 00:30:49,068
(Every photo is full of mischief.)

716
00:30:50,403 --> 00:30:51,871
That's cute.

717
00:30:51,871 --> 00:30:53,540
Look at his expression and his smile.

718
00:30:55,909 --> 00:30:58,044
- He's adorable.
- So handsome.

719
00:30:58,044 --> 00:30:59,078
He's so cute.

720
00:31:04,851 --> 00:31:06,085
He's really...

721
00:31:06,085 --> 00:31:07,387
That looks pretty.

722
00:31:10,857 --> 00:31:12,058
He looks like the student body president.

723
00:31:13,092 --> 00:31:15,628
I actually was president in high school.

724
00:31:15,628 --> 00:31:17,363
I knew it.

725
00:31:17,363 --> 00:31:19,165
That's why he's such a good MC.

726
00:31:20,133 --> 00:31:22,001
He's so handsome.

727
00:31:22,001 --> 00:31:27,307
In college, I got interested in cars.

728
00:31:27,307 --> 00:31:30,076
We built that ourselves.

729
00:31:30,076 --> 00:31:35,615
I didn't do it alone. My team built it.

730
00:31:35,615 --> 00:31:37,917
You even took all the wheels off.

731
00:31:37,917 --> 00:31:39,719
(Engineering student Ryun Gi
even built a car.)

732
00:31:40,553 --> 00:31:41,654
My goodness.

733
00:31:41,654 --> 00:31:43,122
What's with all of you?

734
00:31:43,122 --> 00:31:45,058
You all look like actors.

735
00:31:45,558 --> 00:31:46,993
That's a great picture.

736
00:31:46,993 --> 00:31:48,061
So handsome.

737
00:31:48,061 --> 00:31:49,662
He's so handsome. That photo looks like...

738
00:31:49,662 --> 00:31:50,597
Exactly.

739
00:31:50,597 --> 00:31:51,731
First, my age.

740
00:31:53,333 --> 00:31:54,434
I am...

741
00:31:55,168 --> 00:31:56,936
the same age as Ro Bin.

742
00:31:57,637 --> 00:31:58,771
What?

743
00:31:59,539 --> 00:32:00,340
Wait, what?

744
00:32:00,340 --> 00:32:02,008
- How old is someone born in 2000?
- What year?

745
00:32:02,008 --> 00:32:03,543
Twenty-six?

746
00:32:03,543 --> 00:32:05,278
- Twenty-seven.
- Right, 27.

747
00:32:05,278 --> 00:32:07,380
First of all,

748
00:32:10,450 --> 00:32:12,852
I'm a researcher at a defense company.

749
00:32:12,852 --> 00:32:14,020
Cool.

750
00:32:14,554 --> 00:32:16,122
(Surprised)

751
00:32:16,122 --> 00:32:17,457
Before that,

752
00:32:17,457 --> 00:32:21,160
I worked at a robotics company...

753
00:32:21,160 --> 00:32:25,398
and briefly at an automaker. Now,

754
00:32:25,865 --> 00:32:29,669
I have a more stable position...

755
00:32:29,669 --> 00:32:32,605
as a researcher at a defense company.

756
00:32:32,605 --> 00:32:34,240
That's incredible.

757
00:32:34,974 --> 00:32:38,244
(Changwon, Gyeongsangnam-do)

758
00:32:45,018 --> 00:32:48,021
I'm a researcher at a defense company.

759
00:32:49,956 --> 00:32:52,392
I mainly develop systems...

760
00:32:52,392 --> 00:32:54,627
used in defense equipment such as
self-propelled guns, armored vehicles,

761
00:32:54,627 --> 00:32:56,329
and missiles.

762
00:32:57,864 --> 00:33:01,634
Those vehicles contain various systems.

763
00:33:02,168 --> 00:33:04,204
I connect them all...

764
00:33:04,204 --> 00:33:06,973
so the actual equipment
can operate properly.

765
00:33:06,973 --> 00:33:08,141
That's what I do.

766
00:33:10,176 --> 00:33:12,946
When everything I've designed fits...

767
00:33:12,946 --> 00:33:15,915
and I see it work, it's thrilling.

768
00:33:17,617 --> 00:33:21,821
I enjoy seeing ideas become reality.

769
00:33:23,456 --> 00:33:25,491
- That's incredible.
- Amazing.

770
00:33:25,491 --> 00:33:27,093
- Impressive.
- So incredible.

771
00:33:27,093 --> 00:33:28,795
- That's impressive.
- You're amazing.

772
00:33:30,163 --> 00:33:31,698
How is everyone so impressive?

773
00:33:32,232 --> 00:33:34,868
I think we'll still use honorifics.

774
00:33:34,868 --> 00:33:36,269
Right?

775
00:33:36,269 --> 00:33:37,837
Whatever feels comfortable.

776
00:33:37,837 --> 00:33:39,172
However each person wants.

777
00:33:39,572 --> 00:33:43,309
I want you guys to be my big sisters now.

778
00:33:44,277 --> 00:33:46,479
Then go ahead.

779
00:33:46,479 --> 00:33:47,614
She suddenly seems like a baby.

780
00:33:49,249 --> 00:33:50,550
Then,

781
00:33:50,550 --> 00:33:51,551
you're my little brother.

782
00:33:52,852 --> 00:33:53,786
Big bro.

783
00:33:54,554 --> 00:33:56,589
I knew you were the goofy big brother.

784
00:33:56,589 --> 00:33:58,458
(A night of getting to know each other)

785
00:34:05,498 --> 00:34:07,166
That feels so good.

786
00:34:07,166 --> 00:34:08,668
I knew my guess was right.

787
00:34:09,168 --> 00:34:10,270
So we're the same age.

788
00:34:10,270 --> 00:34:11,371
Hey.

789
00:34:11,371 --> 00:34:12,505
Seriously.

790
00:34:13,172 --> 00:34:15,408
How dare you say I seemed younger?

791
00:34:17,377 --> 00:34:18,578
Ryun Gi.

792
00:34:20,446 --> 00:34:23,316
How is the Room of Time?

793
00:34:23,316 --> 00:34:24,517
It's so hard.

794
00:34:25,518 --> 00:34:27,387
(Troubled)

795
00:34:28,087 --> 00:34:31,357
Now that I know their ages and jobs,

796
00:34:31,357 --> 00:34:33,059
I think age is the biggest factor.

797
00:34:34,928 --> 00:34:37,197
You may have been afraid to reveal it.

798
00:34:37,197 --> 00:34:38,598
But you really wanted to.

799
00:34:39,966 --> 00:34:41,668
You said you were so curious
about everyone's ages.

800
00:34:41,668 --> 00:34:42,535
Right?

801
00:34:42,535 --> 00:34:43,903
I was curious,

802
00:34:43,903 --> 00:34:45,405
but now that I know...

803
00:34:47,440 --> 00:34:50,944
(Do Gon has mixed feelings
after the age reveal.)

804
00:34:51,544 --> 00:34:55,682
(Where will everyone's time flow tonight?)

805
00:34:56,749 --> 00:35:00,053
(The Room of Time of Day 3 is open.)

806
00:35:01,788 --> 00:35:07,527
(Do Gon enters the Room of Time first.)

807
00:35:09,662 --> 00:35:10,663
What?

808
00:35:11,798 --> 00:35:15,335
(What surprises Do Gon?)

809
00:35:15,951 --> 00:35:19,455
A date requires at least 110 minutes.

810
00:35:21,690 --> 00:35:25,961
(At least 110 minutes)

811
00:35:26,495 --> 00:35:27,996
(Startled)

812
00:35:28,363 --> 00:35:30,032
It's gone up by ten minutes.

813
00:35:30,032 --> 00:35:31,934
A one-sided pick won't work anymore.

814
00:35:31,934 --> 00:35:34,069
Even if they give someone 100 minutes,
they won't get a date?

815
00:35:34,069 --> 00:35:36,238
Even if I use all 100 minutes?

816
00:35:36,238 --> 00:35:38,006
There are no more one-sided dates.

817
00:35:38,006 --> 00:35:38,907
You're right.

818
00:35:38,907 --> 00:35:41,210
The other person needs to give
at least ten minutes as well.

819
00:35:41,210 --> 00:35:42,945
What will Do Gon choose?

820
00:35:45,777 --> 00:35:47,983
Even if I use all 100 minutes now,

821
00:35:49,351 --> 00:35:50,853
we may not get a date.

822
00:35:53,322 --> 00:35:54,189
This is hard.

823
00:35:57,259 --> 00:35:59,328
I think that made me deliberate more.

824
00:36:08,437 --> 00:36:12,040
We also revealed our jobs and ages today.

825
00:36:12,608 --> 00:36:15,444
I was born in 2000. I'm 27.

826
00:36:15,444 --> 00:36:17,446
Born in 2000.

827
00:36:17,446 --> 00:36:20,716
Our gap is even more than twice
the four years she mentioned.

828
00:36:25,254 --> 00:36:28,190
If I kept giving Ro Bin 100 minutes...

829
00:36:28,190 --> 00:36:30,325
and going on dates with her,

830
00:36:30,325 --> 00:36:33,495
it might become a burden for her.

831
00:36:40,469 --> 00:36:45,674
(His feelings stop at 60 minutes.)

832
00:36:49,878 --> 00:36:51,780
I thought that, if I got a chance,

833
00:36:51,780 --> 00:36:56,552
I might be able to talk to someone else.

834
00:36:58,187 --> 00:37:02,724
(He gives time to someone else
for the first time.)

835
00:37:04,326 --> 00:37:06,528
(Deliberates)

836
00:37:07,096 --> 00:37:08,197
Still,

837
00:37:08,864 --> 00:37:12,067
I do have feelings for Ro Bin.

838
00:37:12,067 --> 00:37:13,936
I really was attracted to her.

839
00:37:14,837 --> 00:37:16,105
If it's only ten minutes...

840
00:37:21,376 --> 00:37:24,646
(He moves 20 minutes back to Ro Bin.)

841
00:37:27,883 --> 00:37:29,184
You fool.

842
00:37:29,184 --> 00:37:30,853
What are we going to do?

843
00:37:31,253 --> 00:37:32,187
This hurts.

844
00:37:34,690 --> 00:37:35,691
Seriously.

845
00:37:35,691 --> 00:37:37,826
He's hopeless.

846
00:37:37,826 --> 00:37:39,862
A fool who only sees Ro Bin.

847
00:37:39,862 --> 00:37:40,963
What a fool.

848
00:37:41,396 --> 00:37:42,698
You fool.

849
00:37:42,698 --> 00:37:43,832
But I love this.

850
00:37:44,399 --> 00:37:46,168
This is the best.

851
00:37:46,168 --> 00:37:47,603
I love it so much.

852
00:37:48,837 --> 00:37:52,241
I worried about burdening her,
so I wanted to be careful.

853
00:37:53,008 --> 00:37:54,443
But I still wanted...

854
00:37:54,443 --> 00:37:57,246
to talk with her at least once more.

855
00:37:58,280 --> 00:38:00,582
That's why I gave her 80 minutes.

856
00:38:00,582 --> 00:38:04,486
(He holds back his feelings for her sake.)

857
00:38:05,521 --> 00:38:10,192
(Who will Ro Bin give her time to?)

858
00:38:14,029 --> 00:38:15,631
I felt sorry.

859
00:38:20,002 --> 00:38:22,704
There are so many things I like about him.

860
00:38:22,704 --> 00:38:23,705
There are,

861
00:38:24,807 --> 00:38:26,875
but I can't get past the age difference.

862
00:38:33,782 --> 00:38:34,883
Just one more.

863
00:38:34,883 --> 00:38:36,385
- We don't know yet.
- She put in two, right?

864
00:38:36,385 --> 00:38:37,719
If she adds one more...

865
00:38:37,719 --> 00:38:39,188
Just one more. Please, one more.

866
00:38:40,289 --> 00:38:43,492
She's still holding them. Wait.

867
00:38:43,859 --> 00:38:47,062
Please, just one more.

868
00:38:47,329 --> 00:38:48,397
Wait.

869
00:38:49,998 --> 00:38:51,300
Get up.

870
00:38:51,300 --> 00:38:52,768
- Pray with all your heart.
- Please.

871
00:38:54,236 --> 00:38:55,537
- Just one more, Ro Bin.
- One more.

872
00:38:55,537 --> 00:38:56,772
Listen to me just this once.

873
00:38:58,173 --> 00:38:59,741
(Please)

874
00:39:00,375 --> 00:39:03,846
(One piece away from a date match)

875
00:39:05,380 --> 00:39:09,318
(Where will Ro Bin's feelings go?)

876
00:39:26,368 --> 00:39:29,238
(She gives Jong Eun 80 minutes.)

877
00:39:30,472 --> 00:39:35,144
(Her time for Do Gon stops at 20 minutes.)

878
00:39:36,912 --> 00:39:38,313
Seriously?

879
00:39:38,313 --> 00:39:40,048
They have 100 minutes.
The old rule would've worked.

880
00:39:41,116 --> 00:39:42,451
No.

881
00:39:42,451 --> 00:39:44,119
The new rule means it won't?

882
00:39:45,587 --> 00:39:47,523
- Wait.
- This can't be happening.

883
00:39:47,523 --> 00:39:49,158
This is a cruel twist of fate.

884
00:39:49,158 --> 00:39:49,925
But wait.

885
00:39:49,925 --> 00:39:51,760
Do Gon only needed to add ten minutes.

886
00:39:52,628 --> 00:39:54,430
That's true too.

887
00:39:54,430 --> 00:39:56,899
Can ten minutes really cause this?

888
00:39:56,899 --> 00:39:58,333
Wait, I just got chills.

889
00:39:58,333 --> 00:40:00,436
This really gives me chills.

890
00:40:00,436 --> 00:40:02,971
What do we do?

891
00:40:02,971 --> 00:40:05,641
- This is unbelievable.
- The day the rule changed...

892
00:40:05,641 --> 00:40:07,976
They miss a date by ten minutes
on the day the rule changes.

893
00:40:07,976 --> 00:40:09,178
Of all days.

894
00:40:09,178 --> 00:40:11,847
Those 20 minutes show...

895
00:40:11,847 --> 00:40:14,416
a huge change in Ro Bin's feelings.

896
00:40:14,416 --> 00:40:17,219
She went from zero to something.

897
00:40:17,219 --> 00:40:19,254
But Do Gon doesn't know that.

898
00:40:19,254 --> 00:40:20,456
This is such a shame.

899
00:40:20,456 --> 00:40:21,390
I'm so disappointed.

900
00:40:22,124 --> 00:40:24,393
(Upset)

901
00:40:24,626 --> 00:40:27,229
I thought I was...

902
00:40:28,197 --> 00:40:30,499
pretty forward on our date today.

903
00:40:31,200 --> 00:40:33,702
Did you want to talk with me?

904
00:40:33,702 --> 00:40:36,972
How do you approach someone you like?

905
00:40:36,972 --> 00:40:39,208
I was just curious.

906
00:40:39,208 --> 00:40:41,276
I wanted to know what you were like.

907
00:40:42,277 --> 00:40:44,313
I thought Jong Eun...

908
00:40:44,313 --> 00:40:47,149
had a general idea of how I felt.

909
00:40:47,149 --> 00:40:52,187
I hoped he might have developed...

910
00:40:52,788 --> 00:40:55,057
about 30 minutes of interest in me.

911
00:40:56,525 --> 00:40:58,727
(Ro Bin - 80 minutes - Jong Eun)

912
00:40:58,727 --> 00:41:00,963
(Ro Bin - 20 minutes - Do Gon)

913
00:41:00,963 --> 00:41:04,166
(Will the hope in Ro Bin's time be met?)

914
00:41:13,442 --> 00:41:15,811
(Jong Eun looks conflicted.)

915
00:41:20,282 --> 00:41:23,886
After Min Young, the person I wanted...

916
00:41:24,353 --> 00:41:26,555
to learn more about was Na Young.

917
00:41:28,490 --> 00:41:30,426
My main job is acting.

918
00:41:31,760 --> 00:41:33,328
(Today, he is curious about someone new.)

919
00:41:33,328 --> 00:41:35,063
I was born in January 1994.

920
00:41:36,298 --> 00:41:37,499
That was so unexpected.

921
00:41:38,400 --> 00:41:40,936
I think I was simply curious about her.

922
00:41:46,308 --> 00:41:48,644
I'd like to talk with her one-on-one.

923
00:41:50,245 --> 00:41:54,116
(Where his final piece of time goes)

924
00:41:54,783 --> 00:41:57,920
(Jong Eun - 90 minutes - Na Young)

925
00:41:57,920 --> 00:42:01,056
(Jong Eun - 10 minutes - Min Young)

926
00:42:05,994 --> 00:42:10,432
I worked up the nerve to ask him out.

927
00:42:13,535 --> 00:42:16,672
Actually, Ye Ji and I
are mutual blog followers.

928
00:42:17,306 --> 00:42:18,340
Really?

929
00:42:18,340 --> 00:42:20,609
We used to leave encouraging comments.

930
00:42:20,609 --> 00:42:22,878
- Really?
- I already knew.

931
00:42:22,878 --> 00:42:24,313
(They discover their connection tonight.)

932
00:42:24,313 --> 00:42:27,049
So he clearly knows who he wants.

933
00:42:27,049 --> 00:42:28,684
There's no room for me.

934
00:42:28,684 --> 00:42:30,152
It gave me a lot to think about.

935
00:42:32,154 --> 00:42:35,157
(Where Min Young's time goes)

936
00:42:39,528 --> 00:42:41,130
(Kim Ryun Gi)

937
00:42:41,130 --> 00:42:43,332
I'd been so curious about him.

938
00:42:44,032 --> 00:42:47,436
I'm a researcher at a defense company.

939
00:42:47,436 --> 00:42:49,505
(His job sparks a new curiosity.)

940
00:42:50,105 --> 00:42:52,241
He's living such an impressive life.

941
00:42:55,144 --> 00:42:58,080
We might grow closer if we talk.

942
00:43:02,050 --> 00:43:03,519
(Amazing)

943
00:43:04,086 --> 00:43:05,521
Hundred Min Young.

944
00:43:05,521 --> 00:43:06,922
Hundred Min Young.

945
00:43:07,256 --> 00:43:08,857
She's bold.

946
00:43:08,857 --> 00:43:09,858
I love this.

947
00:43:09,858 --> 00:43:12,161
Their jobs clearly made a difference.

948
00:43:13,929 --> 00:43:19,568
(Min Young - 100 minutes - Ryun Gi)

949
00:43:22,004 --> 00:43:26,008
(Na Young also enters the Room of Time.)

950
00:43:26,575 --> 00:43:29,344
(Deliberates)

951
00:43:30,045 --> 00:43:31,413
I did struggle with the decision.

952
00:43:33,115 --> 00:43:34,683
Because...

953
00:43:34,683 --> 00:43:37,419
I could tell I had more questions for him.

954
00:43:38,053 --> 00:43:40,722
It felt like I was the only curious one.

955
00:43:40,722 --> 00:43:42,257
So I wanted to ask him more.

956
00:43:42,257 --> 00:43:43,692
Should I go on another date with him?

957
00:43:45,494 --> 00:43:50,933
(Han Do Gon)

958
00:43:50,933 --> 00:43:54,069
But if I wanted that,

959
00:43:54,069 --> 00:43:58,807
I felt I should give him more than 50.

960
00:44:01,877 --> 00:44:05,481
(Her feelings stop at 50 minutes.)

961
00:44:09,918 --> 00:44:12,988
I actually feel that Ryun Gi...

962
00:44:12,988 --> 00:44:17,226
might be on a similar wavelength as me.

963
00:44:17,226 --> 00:44:20,562
I'd like to get closer
and talk with him more.

964
00:44:20,562 --> 00:44:22,431
Honestly, I'm still not sure.

965
00:44:26,135 --> 00:44:28,771
(Kim Ryun Gi)

966
00:44:33,142 --> 00:44:35,577
(Na Young - 50 minutes - Ryun Gi)

967
00:44:35,577 --> 00:44:38,046
(Na Young - 50 minutes - Do Gon)

968
00:44:50,492 --> 00:44:53,028
After spending time
with Ro Bin yesterday,

969
00:44:54,029 --> 00:44:55,864
I had to face...

970
00:44:55,864 --> 00:44:59,134
some concerns I'd been wrestling with.

971
00:45:00,536 --> 00:45:03,472
I organized those thoughts a little...

972
00:45:03,472 --> 00:45:06,608
while I spent time alone today.

973
00:45:12,181 --> 00:45:15,451
I decided to move past that mindset...

974
00:45:15,451 --> 00:45:19,188
and start getting to know someone new.

975
00:45:20,422 --> 00:45:24,860
(Ryun Gi - 60 minutes - Na Young)

976
00:45:26,662 --> 00:45:29,531
And after the age reveal...

977
00:45:30,165 --> 00:45:32,167
Yes, I own an online store.

978
00:45:32,167 --> 00:45:34,736
I make and sell clothes.

979
00:45:34,736 --> 00:45:36,338
How was she born in 2003?

980
00:45:37,039 --> 00:45:39,041
I could learn so much from her.

981
00:45:39,041 --> 00:45:42,344
She may have sides I haven't seen yet.

982
00:45:42,344 --> 00:45:46,148
So I gave the remaining 40 minutes to her.

983
00:45:46,148 --> 00:45:48,217
(Ryun Gi - 40 minutes - Min Young)

984
00:45:49,251 --> 00:45:53,722
(140 minutes,
Kang Min Young and Kim Ryun Gi match.)

985
00:45:54,757 --> 00:46:00,262
(110 minutes,
Kim Na Young and Kim Ryun Gi match.)

986
00:46:00,262 --> 00:46:01,730
No way.

987
00:46:02,097 --> 00:46:03,365
(Cheers)

988
00:46:04,133 --> 00:46:05,200
This is crazy.

989
00:46:05,200 --> 00:46:06,835
This is amazing. I love it.

990
00:46:06,835 --> 00:46:07,970
Everything changed.

991
00:46:07,970 --> 00:46:09,738
- Ryun Gi has two dates.
- Exactly.

992
00:46:10,472 --> 00:46:11,540
What?

993
00:46:11,540 --> 00:46:13,308
He's here. He's coming.

994
00:46:13,308 --> 00:46:14,343
Hurry, pay attention.

995
00:46:14,343 --> 00:46:15,878
Even his back looks different.

996
00:46:15,878 --> 00:46:16,745
Wait.

997
00:46:26,121 --> 00:46:27,556
(Bounces)

998
00:46:28,590 --> 00:46:30,526
Seon Ho has to...

999
00:46:30,526 --> 00:46:31,927
choose very carefully tonight.

1000
00:46:31,927 --> 00:46:34,530
Fifty isn't enough now. No even splits.

1001
00:46:34,530 --> 00:46:35,597
I'm out of drinks.

1002
00:46:37,232 --> 00:46:38,333
All out.

1003
00:46:42,905 --> 00:46:43,806
Let's see.

1004
00:46:44,540 --> 00:46:49,178
(A date requires at least 110 minutes.)

1005
00:46:50,345 --> 00:46:54,883
(Seon Ho reacts strangely
to the new rule.)

1006
00:47:00,289 --> 00:47:01,623
During our date,

1007
00:47:02,257 --> 00:47:04,460
there were things I wanted to know
about Ye Ji.

1008
00:47:07,329 --> 00:47:08,630
I...

1009
00:47:11,066 --> 00:47:14,036
I'll still talk to the others too.

1010
00:47:25,247 --> 00:47:27,649
This may sound arrogant,

1011
00:47:27,649 --> 00:47:29,618
but I wanted to find out...

1012
00:47:29,618 --> 00:47:31,053
how much she felt for me.

1013
00:47:31,720 --> 00:47:32,721
So...

1014
00:47:35,124 --> 00:47:38,060
(Seon Ho - 50 minutes - Ye Ji)

1015
00:47:40,562 --> 00:47:42,264
Goodness.

1016
00:47:42,264 --> 00:47:44,399
Because 60 from her would make a match?

1017
00:47:44,900 --> 00:47:46,301
He wants reassurance?

1018
00:47:46,301 --> 00:47:49,538
Seon Ho could add one more.

1019
00:47:49,538 --> 00:47:51,173
He doesn't want to.

1020
00:47:51,173 --> 00:47:54,076
He could just add one more.

1021
00:47:54,076 --> 00:47:57,279
Something is holding Seon Ho back.

1022
00:47:58,514 --> 00:48:00,816
- But he's been consistent.
- He has.

1023
00:48:00,816 --> 00:48:01,650
He really has.

1024
00:48:04,620 --> 00:48:10,092
Does she feel more than 50 minutes?

1025
00:48:10,092 --> 00:48:11,660
Just 50 minutes...

1026
00:48:11,660 --> 00:48:13,562
If she doesn't feel more than that,

1027
00:48:13,562 --> 00:48:15,264
the date won't happen.

1028
00:48:15,631 --> 00:48:18,434
I'm curious about her as a woman.

1029
00:48:19,768 --> 00:48:24,139
(Seon Ho chooses to seek certainty.)

1030
00:48:25,841 --> 00:48:27,543
One hundred ten minutes.

1031
00:48:31,513 --> 00:48:33,282
(Hesitates)

1032
00:48:53,869 --> 00:48:58,507
(Someone gets all 100 minutes
for the first time.)

1033
00:48:59,808 --> 00:49:03,679
(Who receives this bold choice?)

1034
00:49:04,947 --> 00:49:06,715
She boldly gave all 100 minutes
for the first time.

1035
00:49:07,783 --> 00:49:08,984
Please don't end it there.

1036
00:49:08,984 --> 00:49:10,819
I'm begging you. Don't end it here.

1037
00:49:10,819 --> 00:49:12,387
What? No way.

1038
00:49:12,755 --> 00:49:14,056
You're ending it here?

1039
00:49:14,056 --> 00:49:15,491
Tell us.

1040
00:49:15,991 --> 00:49:17,359
Seriously.

1041
00:49:17,359 --> 00:49:19,027
(Frustrated)

1042
00:49:21,296 --> 00:49:24,233
(The Room of Time of Day 3 closes.)

1043
00:49:25,434 --> 00:49:27,202
(They talk in the living room
late into the night.)

1044
00:49:27,202 --> 00:49:28,804
If it works out, let's all have a party.

1045
00:49:28,804 --> 00:49:29,738
Seriously.

1046
00:49:32,641 --> 00:49:34,009
Let's throw an even bigger party.

1047
00:49:34,810 --> 00:49:38,856
(Seo Ro Bin, you have no date tomorrow.)

1048
00:49:38,857 --> 00:49:42,418
The text said,
"Seo Ro Bin, you have no date tomorrow."

1049
00:49:44,520 --> 00:49:45,921
Jong Eun...

1050
00:49:46,355 --> 00:49:51,093
didn't feel even 30 minutes
of interest in me, I guess.

1051
00:49:52,027 --> 00:49:55,764
(Ro Bin's feelings don't reach Jong Eun.)

1052
00:49:56,732 --> 00:50:00,169
But I can't help where my heart goes.

1053
00:50:01,937 --> 00:50:05,107
(Ro Bin quietly goes upstairs alone.)

1054
00:50:05,441 --> 00:50:08,477
(She calls someone.)

1055
00:50:09,244 --> 00:50:10,479
Mom.

1056
00:50:10,479 --> 00:50:11,280
Hi, honey.

1057
00:50:11,280 --> 00:50:13,682
Mom, I'm doing well here.

1058
00:50:13,682 --> 00:50:14,650
Are you doing okay?

1059
00:50:14,650 --> 00:50:16,485
You were asleep, weren't you?

1060
00:50:16,485 --> 00:50:17,786
I had just lain down.

1061
00:50:17,986 --> 00:50:20,389
There's someone I'm interested in,

1062
00:50:20,389 --> 00:50:23,125
but he doesn't seem interested in me.

1063
00:50:23,692 --> 00:50:25,094
He's not interested?

1064
00:50:25,094 --> 00:50:27,396
Really? Do you like him?

1065
00:50:27,396 --> 00:50:28,530
I do.

1066
00:50:28,530 --> 00:50:30,265
We went on a date,

1067
00:50:30,265 --> 00:50:32,201
and he said...

1068
00:50:32,201 --> 00:50:33,969
he never saw it coming.

1069
00:50:33,969 --> 00:50:36,338
I thought I was...

1070
00:50:36,338 --> 00:50:39,575
gradually making the first move.

1071
00:50:39,575 --> 00:50:42,444
But he hadn't noticed at all.

1072
00:50:42,444 --> 00:50:43,612
Really?

1073
00:50:43,612 --> 00:50:47,683
Why isn't the guy you like
interested in you?

1074
00:50:47,683 --> 00:50:49,985
Is he interested in someone else?

1075
00:50:49,985 --> 00:50:51,286
I think so.

1076
00:50:51,787 --> 00:50:53,388
You think so, or you know so?

1077
00:50:53,388 --> 00:50:56,225
I think so.

1078
00:50:56,225 --> 00:51:01,296
We played table tennis together today.

1079
00:51:01,296 --> 00:51:04,099
He's good. I lost.

1080
00:51:04,099 --> 00:51:09,037
The loser had to grant a wish.

1081
00:51:09,037 --> 00:51:12,074
I held back a little on purpose.

1082
00:51:13,008 --> 00:51:16,044
The loser had to grant a wish,

1083
00:51:16,044 --> 00:51:18,814
and I was dying to know what he'd ask for.

1084
00:51:18,814 --> 00:51:20,516
He doesn't talk much.

1085
00:51:20,516 --> 00:51:22,484
Apparently, he's also extremely shy.

1086
00:51:24,753 --> 00:51:26,455
What now?

1087
00:51:26,789 --> 00:51:28,490
That's adorable.

1088
00:51:28,490 --> 00:51:30,092
She only has eyes for Jong Eun now.

1089
00:51:30,092 --> 00:51:32,227
- Her feelings are real.
- Absolutely.

1090
00:51:32,227 --> 00:51:33,395
Imagine how excited she must be.

1091
00:51:33,395 --> 00:51:35,697
She came here...

1092
00:51:35,697 --> 00:51:37,599
hoping for her first relationship,

1093
00:51:37,866 --> 00:51:39,301
and then someone she liked appeared.

1094
00:51:39,301 --> 00:51:41,103
So Ro Bin...

1095
00:51:41,103 --> 00:51:42,738
can only think about Jong Eun.

1096
00:51:43,939 --> 00:51:46,341
Everything he does makes her happy.

1097
00:51:46,341 --> 00:51:48,343
She loves everything he does right now.

1098
00:51:48,343 --> 00:51:49,311
How cute.

1099
00:51:51,113 --> 00:51:55,384
He apparently runs really hot.

1100
00:51:55,384 --> 00:51:59,054
But it was freezing today, Mom.

1101
00:51:59,054 --> 00:52:01,290
I hadn't brought a jacket,

1102
00:52:01,290 --> 00:52:02,925
and he took his off and gave it to me.

1103
00:52:03,492 --> 00:52:05,227
(Rolls around)

1104
00:52:06,095 --> 00:52:08,030
It's not over until it's over.

1105
00:52:08,030 --> 00:52:09,731
There's always a twist.

1106
00:52:09,731 --> 00:52:10,699
A twist?

1107
00:52:11,400 --> 00:52:14,703
Mom, I'm curious. If I end up...

1108
00:52:14,703 --> 00:52:16,271
dating someone here,

1109
00:52:16,271 --> 00:52:17,806
it'll be my first relationship.

1110
00:52:17,806 --> 00:52:22,945
If I were to date someone...

1111
00:52:22,945 --> 00:52:25,714
who'd also been seriously ill,
would you support me?

1112
00:52:26,548 --> 00:52:28,217
You should follow your heart.

1113
00:52:28,217 --> 00:52:31,687
I just wanted to know what you thought.

1114
00:52:32,721 --> 00:52:35,858
Even if you date someone healthy,
there are no guarantees.

1115
00:52:35,858 --> 00:52:38,460
But this is your first time...

1116
00:52:38,460 --> 00:52:42,131
meeting someone romantically,

1117
00:52:42,131 --> 00:52:45,367
and you've never dated.
If someone treats you well,

1118
00:52:45,367 --> 00:52:47,836
you could fall too hard too quickly.

1119
00:52:47,836 --> 00:52:49,371
It might be good to watch him for a while.

1120
00:52:50,239 --> 00:52:52,741
I don't know, Mom. This is so hard.

1121
00:52:52,741 --> 00:52:56,345
Dating is so hard, Mom.

1122
00:52:56,345 --> 00:52:59,515
What if I end up leaving here alone?

1123
00:52:59,515 --> 00:53:00,749
- Alone?
- Yeah.

1124
00:53:01,183 --> 00:53:02,084
Really?

1125
00:53:03,085 --> 00:53:03,952
Mom.

1126
00:53:05,988 --> 00:53:07,389
It's hard.

1127
00:53:07,389 --> 00:53:09,925
But you haven't dated much either, Mom.

1128
00:53:10,492 --> 00:53:11,560
I don't know either.

1129
00:53:11,560 --> 00:53:14,029
I wasn't calling you for dating advice.

1130
00:53:14,029 --> 00:53:15,197
I only called to say I'm doing well...

1131
00:53:15,197 --> 00:53:17,399
and explain what's happening here.

1132
00:53:17,399 --> 00:53:20,269
I'll ask Young Soon for dating advice.

1133
00:53:20,269 --> 00:53:21,270
Okay.

1134
00:53:21,270 --> 00:53:25,441
Mom, I'm doing fine, so don't worry.

1135
00:53:25,441 --> 00:53:27,776
I know you're doing well.

1136
00:53:27,776 --> 00:53:28,911
Okay, bye.

1137
00:53:28,911 --> 00:53:30,479
- Okay.
- Bye.

1138
00:53:31,280 --> 00:53:35,217
(While Ro Bin finishes her call,)

1139
00:53:39,021 --> 00:53:42,391
(Jong Eun receives a text.)

1140
00:53:42,658 --> 00:53:46,228
(Kim Jong Eun, you have no date tomorrow.)

1141
00:53:51,967 --> 00:53:56,905
(Kang Min Young, you have a date
with Kim Ryun Gi tomorrow.)

1142
00:53:59,374 --> 00:54:00,509
(Chuckles)

1143
00:54:00,509 --> 00:54:01,410
Talking in the House...

1144
00:54:01,410 --> 00:54:03,846
is different from talking on a date.

1145
00:54:03,846 --> 00:54:06,014
I'm really looking forward to it.

1146
00:54:08,217 --> 00:54:11,253
(What kind of time
will they share together?)

1147
00:54:11,887 --> 00:54:13,622
(Glances)

1148
00:54:15,157 --> 00:54:16,625
This is really bad.

1149
00:54:19,328 --> 00:54:22,030
(An anxious Na Young gets a text too.)

1150
00:54:23,398 --> 00:54:28,670
(Kim Na Young, you have a date
with Kim Ryun Gi tomorrow.)

1151
00:54:31,673 --> 00:54:35,410
I wonder what our date will be like.

1152
00:54:36,044 --> 00:54:39,248
(Their curiosity leads
to their first date.)

1153
00:54:45,954 --> 00:54:51,994
(Kim Ryun Gi, you have dates tomorrow
with Kang Min Young and Kim Na Young.)

1154
00:54:52,327 --> 00:54:54,930
I'm excited about both,

1155
00:54:54,930 --> 00:54:58,534
because they're completely
different people.

1156
00:54:58,901 --> 00:55:01,603
I'm looking forward to seeing...

1157
00:55:01,603 --> 00:55:03,539
what fun we might have together.

1158
00:55:05,340 --> 00:55:08,577
(What changes will the new dates bring?)

1159
00:55:18,587 --> 00:55:22,458
(Ye Ji also receives a text.)

1160
00:55:23,325 --> 00:55:25,360
(Stares)

1161
00:55:28,130 --> 00:55:30,532
Instagram? I don't use it much.

1162
00:55:30,532 --> 00:55:34,103
I used to get many work inquiries there.

1163
00:55:40,976 --> 00:55:44,747
(Two men still haven't received texts.)

1164
00:55:46,615 --> 00:55:48,117
Don't you hear a phone vibrating?

1165
00:55:49,952 --> 00:55:51,420
(Turns quickly)

1166
00:55:52,254 --> 00:55:54,490
(Do Gon doesn't receive a text.)

1167
00:55:54,757 --> 00:55:55,924
My gosh, it must've worked.

1168
00:55:56,925 --> 00:55:58,327
It worked.

1169
00:55:58,327 --> 00:55:59,161
They matched.

1170
00:55:59,161 --> 00:56:00,462
I'm so curious.

1171
00:56:01,697 --> 00:56:03,499
(Focused)

1172
00:56:03,499 --> 00:56:05,033
(Glances)

1173
00:56:09,885 --> 00:56:13,055
(Kim Seon Ho, you have no date tomorrow.)

1174
00:56:20,028 --> 00:56:21,596
(Shocked)

1175
00:56:21,596 --> 00:56:23,265
Who is it?

1176
00:56:24,232 --> 00:56:26,234
Who is it, then?

1177
00:56:27,736 --> 00:56:29,738
- Who did she give her 100 minutes to?
- Wait.

1178
00:56:29,738 --> 00:56:30,906
(Nods)

1179
00:56:30,906 --> 00:56:32,007
Good job, Ye Ji.

1180
00:56:33,575 --> 00:56:34,376
(Laughs)

1181
00:56:34,376 --> 00:56:35,610
Good job, Ye Ji.

1182
00:56:35,610 --> 00:56:36,745
Very good.

1183
00:56:37,379 --> 00:56:38,246
That's it.

1184
00:56:38,947 --> 00:56:39,815
Wait.

1185
00:56:42,184 --> 00:56:44,586
(Kim Seon Ho, you have no date tomorrow.)

1186
00:56:47,322 --> 00:56:51,560
(Ye Ji didn't choose Seon Ho tonight.)

1187
00:57:00,802 --> 00:57:02,671
(Glances)

1188
00:57:08,710 --> 00:57:14,116
(Han Do Gon, you have a date
with Jung Ye Ji tomorrow.)

1189
00:57:17,419 --> 00:57:18,954
From that one piece he added?

1190
00:57:19,688 --> 00:57:21,757
(Shocked)

1191
00:57:21,757 --> 00:57:22,858
From the one piece Do Gon added?

1192
00:57:22,858 --> 00:57:23,859
Just that one piece.

1193
00:57:23,859 --> 00:57:25,494
She gave all her time to Do Gon.

1194
00:57:25,494 --> 00:57:26,628
This is getting interesting.

1195
00:57:26,628 --> 00:57:27,996
This is so much fun.

1196
00:57:27,996 --> 00:57:29,264
(Amazed)

1197
00:57:29,264 --> 00:57:31,900
Ten minutes keeps twisting their fate.

1198
00:57:32,768 --> 00:57:34,369
This is unbelievable.

1199
00:57:34,369 --> 00:57:35,971
- This can't be real.
- Exactly.

1200
00:57:35,971 --> 00:57:38,273
(Chills)

1201
00:57:38,273 --> 00:57:40,776
(1 hour earlier)

1202
00:57:44,212 --> 00:57:47,983
(Where Ye Ji's time went)

1203
00:57:48,650 --> 00:57:52,454
(Ye Ji - 100 minutes - Do Gon)

1204
00:57:52,454 --> 00:57:55,657
I still think Seon Ho...

1205
00:57:57,459 --> 00:58:01,496
might be interested in someone else too.

1206
00:58:01,496 --> 00:58:03,598
That's how I feel.

1207
00:58:03,598 --> 00:58:05,600
(During today's date)

1208
00:58:06,201 --> 00:58:07,469
You know how it is.

1209
00:58:07,469 --> 00:58:10,305
Do you go all in on one person,

1210
00:58:10,305 --> 00:58:13,375
or get to know several people?

1211
00:58:14,710 --> 00:58:17,946
I want to make the most
of the time I have.

1212
00:58:17,946 --> 00:58:19,815
I want to talk with all of them.

1213
00:58:19,815 --> 00:58:23,552
I might find someone I click with.

1214
00:58:24,920 --> 00:58:27,656
I thought that, for tomorrow's date,

1215
00:58:27,656 --> 00:58:30,092
Seon Ho might choose someone else.

1216
00:58:30,092 --> 00:58:31,593
He might give his time to someone else.

1217
00:58:32,794 --> 00:58:35,530
Instead of staying in this gray area,

1218
00:58:35,530 --> 00:58:38,667
I decided to talk with someone...

1219
00:58:38,667 --> 00:58:40,335
I'd been wanting to know better.

1220
00:58:40,335 --> 00:58:43,305
Maybe Seon Ho made the same choice I did.

1221
00:58:44,139 --> 00:58:46,141
It just...

1222
00:58:46,141 --> 00:58:47,642
didn't feel good.

1223
00:58:47,642 --> 00:58:48,677
At any rate,

1224
00:58:48,677 --> 00:58:51,546
what I did in the Room of Time tonight...

1225
00:58:51,546 --> 00:58:53,815
was a little presumptuous.

1226
00:58:54,850 --> 00:58:55,784
I...

1227
00:58:57,853 --> 00:58:59,454
made that choice expecting something.

1228
00:58:59,454 --> 00:59:01,123
But it didn't work out,

1229
00:59:01,123 --> 00:59:03,158
so I was disappointed and sad.

1230
00:59:04,259 --> 00:59:08,263
Was she not any more curious
or attracted to me than that?

1231
00:59:12,768 --> 00:59:15,203
(As the misunderstanding deepens,)

1232
00:59:15,203 --> 00:59:19,241
(the gap in their time widens.)

1233
00:59:19,775 --> 00:59:24,379
(110 minutes,
Jung Ye Ji and Han Do Gon match.)

1234
00:59:24,379 --> 00:59:29,017
(What ripples will today's choices cause?)

1235
00:59:29,351 --> 00:59:29,985
(Sighs)

1236
00:59:29,985 --> 00:59:30,685
Seriously.

1237
00:59:30,685 --> 00:59:33,021
Things have taken
such an unbelievable turn.

1238
00:59:33,021 --> 00:59:34,556
- This is where we are now.
- Exactly.

1239
00:59:34,556 --> 00:59:35,690
This is what happened.

1240
00:59:35,690 --> 00:59:36,958
It's unbelievable.

1241
00:59:36,958 --> 00:59:39,761
They're all following each other
in a single line.

1242
00:59:39,761 --> 00:59:41,096
No one knows where to go.

1243
00:59:41,096 --> 00:59:43,231
- Where are you going?
- No one looks at each other.

1244
00:59:43,231 --> 00:59:44,366
They're all asking, "Where are you going?"

1245
00:59:44,366 --> 00:59:46,068
(Their feelings form an endless chain.)

1246
00:59:46,068 --> 00:59:47,402
"Where are you going?"

1247
00:59:47,402 --> 00:59:48,503
That's what all of them are doing.

1248
00:59:48,503 --> 00:59:51,106
- They can't catch each other.
- Exactly.

1249
00:59:51,106 --> 00:59:53,475
(He's especially worked up today.)

1250
00:59:53,475 --> 00:59:54,910
This is hilarious.

1251
00:59:54,910 --> 00:59:56,611
You're the funniest one.

1252
00:59:59,848 --> 01:00:03,018
(After everyone checks their texts)

1253
01:00:03,752 --> 01:00:06,354
Ye Ji, could you get my bag later?

1254
01:00:06,354 --> 01:00:08,223
Right. I need to give it back.

1255
01:00:09,224 --> 01:00:10,292
Do you want it now?

1256
01:00:13,228 --> 01:00:17,432
(At Seon Ho's request,
they head to the second floor.)

1257
01:00:18,033 --> 01:00:19,267
Wait, this...

1258
01:00:19,267 --> 01:00:20,969
(Seon Ho's bag was in the women's room.)

1259
01:00:20,969 --> 01:00:22,537
Which of these two is it?

1260
01:00:22,537 --> 01:00:23,705
Can I go in?

1261
01:00:23,705 --> 01:00:24,506
Yes.

1262
01:00:27,209 --> 01:00:29,044
It's this one. I think this is it.

1263
01:00:29,044 --> 01:00:29,845
Just that one?

1264
01:00:29,845 --> 01:00:30,779
Thank you.

1265
01:00:38,954 --> 01:00:40,288
(Sighs)

1266
01:00:41,089 --> 01:00:42,124
(Laughs)

1267
01:00:42,124 --> 01:00:43,392
Or...

1268
01:00:43,392 --> 01:00:44,292
Yes?

1269
01:00:45,026 --> 01:00:45,927
do you want to go outside?

1270
01:00:45,927 --> 01:00:46,895
Sure.

1271
01:00:47,496 --> 01:00:49,398
I've really wanted to go out there.

1272
01:00:49,398 --> 01:00:51,933
(Ye Ji suggests that they talk.)

1273
01:00:52,200 --> 01:00:53,101
What?

1274
01:00:53,101 --> 01:00:54,302
Ask him.

1275
01:00:54,302 --> 01:00:55,103
Exactly.

1276
01:00:55,103 --> 01:00:56,705
I just want them to talk.

1277
01:00:56,705 --> 01:00:57,639
Get it all out in the open.

1278
01:00:57,639 --> 01:00:59,641
They both know...

1279
01:00:59,641 --> 01:01:00,909
their date wasn't matched.

1280
01:01:00,909 --> 01:01:02,477
Now they need to be honest.

1281
01:01:02,477 --> 01:01:03,845
(Hopeful)

1282
01:01:04,179 --> 01:01:05,947
I've never been out here before.

1283
01:01:05,947 --> 01:01:08,050
You've never been out here? Really?

1284
01:01:12,187 --> 01:01:16,658
(Silence falls as they sit side by side.)

1285
01:01:18,560 --> 01:01:19,528
Do you have a date tomorrow?

1286
01:01:22,664 --> 01:01:26,635
(Ye Ji breaks the silence.)

1287
01:01:32,674 --> 01:01:33,875
Well,

1288
01:01:38,980 --> 01:01:39,981
no.

1289
01:01:42,284 --> 01:01:43,819
- You don't?
- No.

1290
01:01:44,713 --> 01:01:47,016
(Stares)

1291
01:01:49,284 --> 01:01:50,719
(Flustered)

1292
01:01:50,719 --> 01:01:51,754
Really?

1293
01:01:51,754 --> 01:01:52,988
Did you get a text?

1294
01:01:56,158 --> 01:01:57,159
Who knows?

1295
01:02:00,229 --> 01:02:01,430
Well...

1296
01:02:03,265 --> 01:02:04,500
I was sure...

1297
01:02:04,500 --> 01:02:06,935
Seon Ho would date someone else.

1298
01:02:06,935 --> 01:02:08,203
So...

1299
01:02:08,203 --> 01:02:09,938
I wondered what was happening.

1300
01:02:09,938 --> 01:02:11,540
When I heard that answer,

1301
01:02:12,041 --> 01:02:15,577
I couldn't make sense of it.

1302
01:02:15,577 --> 01:02:17,146
I realized we were in trouble.

1303
01:02:17,146 --> 01:02:19,682
Something had gone wrong.
That's when I knew.

1304
01:02:23,118 --> 01:02:24,186
Do you have a date tomorrow?

1305
01:02:26,455 --> 01:02:27,823
A date?

1306
01:02:27,823 --> 01:02:28,991
Probably.

1307
01:02:30,359 --> 01:02:32,795
I think so.

1308
01:02:34,997 --> 01:02:39,768
(He learns she's dating someone else.)

1309
01:02:40,169 --> 01:02:41,537
(Groans)

1310
01:02:42,404 --> 01:02:44,707
Why is this so awkward?

1311
01:02:44,940 --> 01:02:46,542
Seon Ho seems...

1312
01:02:46,542 --> 01:02:47,609
a little anxious now, doesn't he?

1313
01:02:47,609 --> 01:02:49,979
It does feel that way.

1314
01:02:49,979 --> 01:02:52,114
Like, "Why didn't you give me your time?"

1315
01:02:53,048 --> 01:02:55,050
Seon Ho needs to be clear now.

1316
01:02:55,050 --> 01:02:56,552
Right. I think he does.

1317
01:02:56,552 --> 01:02:57,720
If he keeps being vague,

1318
01:02:57,720 --> 01:02:59,421
it will only...

1319
01:02:59,421 --> 01:03:01,056
- confuse Ye Ji.
- That's all it does.

1320
01:03:06,895 --> 01:03:10,032
Did you struggle with your choice tonight?

1321
01:03:10,032 --> 01:03:11,166
- Tonight?
- Yes.

1322
01:03:12,234 --> 01:03:14,236
Well, a little.

1323
01:03:14,236 --> 01:03:15,804
I think I struggled a little.

1324
01:03:20,275 --> 01:03:25,214
(Seon Ho says he struggled to choose.)

1325
01:03:28,217 --> 01:03:31,153
So was the decision easy?

1326
01:03:31,153 --> 01:03:32,521
It was hard.

1327
01:03:32,521 --> 01:03:33,789
Did you think about it a lot?

1328
01:03:35,624 --> 01:03:38,160
I really...

1329
01:03:38,827 --> 01:03:40,562
I think this was my hardest choice.

1330
01:03:42,798 --> 01:03:45,968
(They carefully choose every word.)

1331
01:03:49,772 --> 01:03:51,006
What made it hard?

1332
01:03:57,379 --> 01:03:59,882
Exactly. What was I debating?

1333
01:04:03,986 --> 01:04:05,654
(Glances)

1334
01:04:08,691 --> 01:04:10,559
(Deliberates)

1335
01:04:12,628 --> 01:04:13,963
No comment.

1336
01:04:13,963 --> 01:04:15,597
Seriously?

1337
01:04:15,998 --> 01:04:17,199
Come on!

1338
01:04:18,133 --> 01:04:20,035
Wait. Shouldn't we bring Seon Ho...

1339
01:04:20,035 --> 01:04:21,971
on the show next time?

1340
01:04:22,938 --> 01:04:24,506
Should we give him some counseling?

1341
01:04:25,374 --> 01:04:26,875
Wait.

1342
01:04:26,875 --> 01:04:28,544
"No comment."

1343
01:04:29,078 --> 01:04:30,112
Wait.

1344
01:04:30,679 --> 01:04:32,414
I'm not even kidding.

1345
01:04:32,414 --> 01:04:35,584
Of all the possibilities I imagined...

1346
01:04:35,584 --> 01:04:36,618
That wasn't one of them?

1347
01:04:36,618 --> 01:04:38,087
- It wasn't.
- Me neither.

1348
01:04:38,087 --> 01:04:39,254
No comment" wasn't one of them.

1349
01:04:39,254 --> 01:04:40,656
It wasn't on my list either.

1350
01:04:41,256 --> 01:04:42,758
(Exasperated)

1351
01:04:43,125 --> 01:04:44,493
No comment.

1352
01:04:44,493 --> 01:04:46,095
Seriously?

1353
01:04:50,432 --> 01:04:55,104
(Seon Ho doesn't answer Ye Ji.)

1354
01:04:58,007 --> 01:05:03,479
(He hides his feelings in the silence.)

1355
01:05:04,680 --> 01:05:06,915
Who will be home tomorrow?

1356
01:05:09,752 --> 01:05:10,686
Good question.

1357
01:05:12,554 --> 01:05:15,357
(Ponders)

1358
01:05:19,161 --> 01:05:21,897
As far as I know,

1359
01:05:23,699 --> 01:05:26,402
it'll probably be cold again tomorrow.

1360
01:05:27,603 --> 01:05:31,006
Colder than Days One and Two,
especially after the rain.

1361
01:05:31,006 --> 01:05:32,608
Wait, the rain suddenly...

1362
01:05:33,442 --> 01:05:36,011
It's telling me to stop talking.

1363
01:05:37,212 --> 01:05:41,016
(The rain suddenly pours harder.)

1364
01:05:41,950 --> 01:05:43,952
It'll be about as cold as today,

1365
01:05:44,253 --> 01:05:45,187
as far as I know.

1366
01:05:47,823 --> 01:05:49,591
(Stares)

1367
01:05:52,428 --> 01:05:54,897
What's this again?

1368
01:05:54,897 --> 01:05:56,498
He's confusing her again?

1369
01:05:56,498 --> 01:05:58,233
That's criminal. Seriously.

1370
01:05:58,233 --> 01:05:59,868
I'll be home,

1371
01:05:59,868 --> 01:06:01,236
but dress warmly when you go out."

1372
01:06:01,236 --> 01:06:02,338
That's what he means, right?

1373
01:06:02,338 --> 01:06:05,140
I think he's saying, "Notice that."

1374
01:06:05,140 --> 01:06:06,308
Hurry inside now.

1375
01:06:08,510 --> 01:06:09,211
It's cold.

1376
01:06:09,211 --> 01:06:10,746
- Ye Na, fix your expression.
- It's cold.

1377
01:06:10,746 --> 01:06:13,148
They'll catch a cold. Go inside.

1378
01:06:15,851 --> 01:06:16,819
Should we go in?

1379
01:06:21,090 --> 01:06:25,527
(Their conversation ends ambiguously.)

1380
01:06:26,895 --> 01:06:28,831
- Gosh.
- What's wrong?

1381
01:06:28,831 --> 01:06:30,132
It keeps bothering me.

1382
01:06:30,132 --> 01:06:31,033
What does?

1383
01:06:34,003 --> 01:06:34,703
What?

1384
01:06:34,703 --> 01:06:36,438
What's wrong?

1385
01:06:36,438 --> 01:06:37,306
No, it's nothing.

1386
01:06:38,540 --> 01:06:40,242
No, it's fine.

1387
01:06:40,242 --> 01:06:41,276
Wait, what exactly is fine?

1388
01:06:42,144 --> 01:06:43,078
Anyway.

1389
01:06:44,246 --> 01:06:48,751
(The mood somehow turns awkward.)

1390
01:06:51,120 --> 01:06:52,121
What's fine?

1391
01:06:52,121 --> 01:06:53,055
You said it's fine.

1392
01:06:56,925 --> 01:07:01,163
(Night deepens as they hide the truth.)

1393
01:07:01,797 --> 01:07:05,534
(Later, Do Gon and Ye Ji clean up.)

1394
01:07:06,602 --> 01:07:08,337
Ye Ji, did you get the text?

1395
01:07:08,337 --> 01:07:10,572
- What?
- Did you get the text?

1396
01:07:10,572 --> 01:07:11,674
(Nods)

1397
01:07:11,674 --> 01:07:13,008
What time would you like?

1398
01:07:14,143 --> 01:07:15,444
(Do Gon brings up their date.)

1399
01:07:15,444 --> 01:07:17,713
Morning or afternoon?

1400
01:07:17,713 --> 01:07:19,181
Should we go later?

1401
01:07:19,181 --> 01:07:20,749
- After resting a little?
- Yes.

1402
01:07:20,749 --> 01:07:21,650
Maybe...

1403
01:07:22,384 --> 01:07:23,652
After lunch?

1404
01:07:23,652 --> 01:07:24,520
Sure.

1405
01:07:25,220 --> 01:07:26,121
Around sunset...

1406
01:07:27,623 --> 01:07:29,558
could be nice too.

1407
01:07:29,558 --> 01:07:30,426
(Seon Ho walks in just then.)

1408
01:07:32,728 --> 01:07:37,700
(Ye Ji doesn't answer Do Gon.)

1409
01:07:38,233 --> 01:07:42,004
(Seon Ho leaves the kitchen.)

1410
01:07:43,105 --> 01:07:47,910
Is there a kind of date you'd like?

1411
01:07:47,910 --> 01:07:49,144
A date I'd like...

1412
01:07:51,513 --> 01:07:54,016
If the weather's nice,
I'd like to go to the Han River.

1413
01:07:54,016 --> 01:07:55,017
The Han River.

1414
01:07:55,551 --> 01:07:57,086
Maybe a picnic by the river.

1415
01:07:57,820 --> 01:08:00,456
I haven't explored this area much.

1416
01:08:00,456 --> 01:08:02,024
(They resume talking about their date.)

1417
01:08:03,826 --> 01:08:07,029
(Then they hear Seon Ho approaching.)

1418
01:08:07,830 --> 01:08:08,664
(Turns quickly)

1419
01:08:11,033 --> 01:08:16,505
(They stop talking.)

1420
01:08:18,340 --> 01:08:19,742
A picnic sounds nice.

1421
01:08:20,843 --> 01:08:22,778
There's really a lot here.

1422
01:08:22,778 --> 01:08:24,046
Right?

1423
01:08:24,046 --> 01:08:25,814
I'll do the plates first.

1424
01:08:28,283 --> 01:08:30,452
- Are you okay washing up?
- Yes.

1425
01:08:31,453 --> 01:08:33,656
When there's this much,
I do it one piece at a time.

1426
01:08:34,857 --> 01:08:36,959
If only we had room for all of this.

1427
01:08:43,365 --> 01:08:46,402
A dishwasher would be perfect.

1428
01:08:46,402 --> 01:08:47,636
Wait. Is this...

1429
01:08:47,636 --> 01:08:48,737
No, it isn't.

1430
01:08:50,039 --> 01:08:53,075
(While the two laugh and talk,)

1431
01:09:01,350 --> 01:09:03,152
Wait a second.

1432
01:09:03,152 --> 01:09:04,687
What?

1433
01:09:04,687 --> 01:09:06,355
Did you see that angle?

1434
01:09:06,922 --> 01:09:08,257
(Deadly)

1435
01:09:08,824 --> 01:09:10,125
That was a little scary.

1436
01:09:10,125 --> 01:09:11,193
You saw that, right?

1437
01:09:11,193 --> 01:09:12,628
His face was half hidden.

1438
01:09:13,829 --> 01:09:15,197
It's like, "I'm watching you."

1439
01:09:19,868 --> 01:09:22,738
(Seon Ho watches the two of them.)

1440
01:09:23,906 --> 01:09:28,644
(He quietly walks away.)

1441
01:09:32,181 --> 01:09:33,115
(Sighs)

1442
01:09:36,618 --> 01:09:41,023
(Seon Ho enters the empty playroom.)

1443
01:10:03,646 --> 01:10:10,586
(He sits lost in thought.)

1444
01:10:16,558 --> 01:10:20,296
(After cleaning up,
Ye Ji returns to her room alone.)

1445
01:10:21,430 --> 01:10:23,465
(Drops onto the bed)

1446
01:10:25,267 --> 01:10:30,105
(A night filled with troubling thoughts)

1447
01:10:33,976 --> 01:10:35,778
Ye Ji, you look exhausted today.

1448
01:10:36,645 --> 01:10:38,480
Did you talk with others today?

1449
01:10:39,114 --> 01:10:41,417
I told you earlier I was torn, right?

1450
01:10:41,417 --> 01:10:43,218
So...

1451
01:10:43,218 --> 01:10:45,054
I just did what I wanted.

1452
01:10:45,054 --> 01:10:45,954
What did you do?

1453
01:10:45,954 --> 01:10:48,357
I asked if he was curious...

1454
01:10:48,357 --> 01:10:50,125
about anyone else,

1455
01:10:50,125 --> 01:10:55,331
but his answer felt vague to me.

1456
01:10:55,331 --> 01:10:57,099
You didn't get the answer you wanted?

1457
01:10:57,099 --> 01:10:58,200
No. So...

1458
01:10:59,234 --> 01:11:03,539
I thought, "Forget it,"
and agonized over it.

1459
01:11:03,539 --> 01:11:06,442
Then I chose someone
I'd been curious about.

1460
01:11:06,442 --> 01:11:08,644
But our timing was completely off.

1461
01:11:08,644 --> 01:11:09,712
You missed each other?

1462
01:11:11,947 --> 01:11:13,248
(Nods)

1463
01:11:13,749 --> 01:11:16,618
How did things end up like this?

1464
01:11:19,188 --> 01:11:24,159
(Where will their mistimed feelings lead?)

1465
01:11:24,627 --> 01:11:27,363
(Morning of Day 4)

1466
01:11:28,497 --> 01:11:29,398
Seon Ho.

1467
01:11:29,398 --> 01:11:30,466
Seon Ho.

1468
01:11:31,634 --> 01:11:34,136
The weather's nice.
Do you want to run by the Han River?

1469
01:11:35,104 --> 01:11:35,971
Yes.

1470
01:11:35,971 --> 01:11:37,139
- Are you up for a run?
- Yes.

1471
01:11:38,907 --> 01:11:40,175
- Get ready.
- Okay.

1472
01:11:40,175 --> 01:11:42,077
(Seon Ho agrees to go for a run
with Do Gon.)

1473
01:11:42,077 --> 01:11:44,246
I had a lot on my mind.

1474
01:11:44,246 --> 01:11:46,315
I needed time to sort out my thoughts.

1475
01:11:48,951 --> 01:11:51,487
(Han River Park)

1476
01:11:52,054 --> 01:11:53,722
The weather really is nice.

1477
01:11:53,722 --> 01:11:55,357
(They head outside
to clear their troubled minds.)

1478
01:11:56,225 --> 01:11:58,093
- It's getting warm.
- Right?

1479
01:11:58,093 --> 01:11:59,261
Yes, I'm sweating.

1480
01:11:59,261 --> 01:12:00,329
You'll work up a sweat quickly.

1481
01:12:01,030 --> 01:12:02,998
What's that, though?

1482
01:12:02,998 --> 01:12:03,899
This?

1483
01:12:03,899 --> 01:12:06,802
The world's top tennis player uses it.

1484
01:12:06,802 --> 01:12:08,003
It's really good.

1485
01:12:08,337 --> 01:12:09,238
It's so comfortable.

1486
01:12:09,238 --> 01:12:11,640
I think I've seen athletes...

1487
01:12:11,640 --> 01:12:12,641
wearing something like that.

1488
01:12:12,641 --> 01:12:13,575
- You have?
- Yes.

1489
01:12:13,909 --> 01:12:17,179
When I wore knee supports to exercise,

1490
01:12:17,179 --> 01:12:19,081
they got so sweaty
that I couldn't really use them.

1491
01:12:19,081 --> 01:12:20,783
But this one stays dry,

1492
01:12:20,783 --> 01:12:22,418
and it feels like it supports my knee.

1493
01:12:23,585 --> 01:12:25,821
It's downhill here,
so we should be careful.

1494
01:12:25,821 --> 01:12:26,955
Let's run slowly.

1495
01:12:29,825 --> 01:12:34,096
(The refreshing weather
puts a spring in their step.)

1496
01:12:34,096 --> 01:12:36,031
The fabric must be good.

1497
01:12:36,031 --> 01:12:37,499
It doesn't feel tight.

1498
01:12:37,499 --> 01:12:38,367
It's so good.

1499
01:12:39,702 --> 01:12:42,404
When I wear this while running,

1500
01:12:42,404 --> 01:12:43,405
the pain seems to disappear.

1501
01:12:43,405 --> 01:12:45,407
My knees are bad too.
Can I try it sometime?

1502
01:12:45,407 --> 01:12:46,575
Of course.

1503
01:12:46,575 --> 01:12:47,443
I highly recommend it.

1504
01:12:47,443 --> 01:12:48,477
Thank you so much.

1505
01:12:50,446 --> 01:12:52,982
Running does feel good.

1506
01:13:06,662 --> 01:13:09,865
(2 hours later)

1507
01:13:10,165 --> 01:13:11,900
Did you eat?

1508
01:13:11,900 --> 01:13:13,569
No, not yet.

1509
01:13:14,670 --> 01:13:15,804
Who's at the House?

1510
01:13:15,804 --> 01:13:17,373
Which of the men are here?

1511
01:13:18,540 --> 01:13:19,842
I don't know either.

1512
01:13:21,410 --> 01:13:25,114
(Ye Ji gets ready for her date
with Do Gon.)

1513
01:13:26,215 --> 01:13:29,118
(Meanwhile, Seon Ho remains in his room.)

1514
01:13:30,219 --> 01:13:31,220
Goodness.

1515
01:13:37,860 --> 01:13:39,595
Seon Ho must have...

1516
01:13:39,595 --> 01:13:40,462
All kinds of thoughts now.

1517
01:13:40,462 --> 01:13:43,399
"I shouldn't have split it 50-50."

1518
01:13:43,399 --> 01:13:45,834
"I should've made my feelings clearer."

1519
01:13:45,834 --> 01:13:48,070
But from Ye Ji's perspective,

1520
01:13:48,070 --> 01:13:49,872
it's important to date someone else too.

1521
01:13:49,872 --> 01:13:51,473
Absolutely. She needs to.

1522
01:13:51,473 --> 01:13:54,310
If she doesn't click with Do Gon,

1523
01:13:54,310 --> 01:13:56,679
she may realize she likes Seon Ho more.

1524
01:13:56,679 --> 01:13:58,814
- Right. Then she can choose.
- She needs this.

1525
01:13:58,814 --> 01:14:00,015
They both need this time.

1526
01:14:00,015 --> 01:14:01,216
Right.

1527
01:14:01,216 --> 01:14:02,851
It's so important for both of them.

1528
01:14:02,851 --> 01:14:04,653
I'm so curious about Do Gon and Ye Ji.

1529
01:14:04,653 --> 01:14:06,822
They may actually be good together.

1530
01:14:06,822 --> 01:14:09,158
I can't picture them, but I'm curious.

1531
01:14:09,158 --> 01:14:10,192
I'm curious too.

1532
01:14:10,192 --> 01:14:11,226
I think it could work.

1533
01:14:11,226 --> 01:14:12,461
It feels like it could.

1534
01:14:13,662 --> 01:14:16,265
(Hannam-dong)

1535
01:14:18,334 --> 01:14:20,269
The weather is so nice today.

1536
01:14:20,269 --> 01:14:21,203
It really is.

1537
01:14:22,404 --> 01:14:23,605
It's picture-perfect.

1538
01:14:26,175 --> 01:14:29,044
Every place we visit today
will be new to you, right?

1539
01:14:29,044 --> 01:14:30,379
Yes, all of them.

1540
01:14:31,513 --> 01:14:32,848
This place has such a great vibe.

1541
01:14:32,848 --> 01:14:34,483
There are so many pretty places here.

1542
01:14:34,483 --> 01:14:35,551
There's lots to see too.

1543
01:14:36,185 --> 01:14:37,853
The fashion, the coffee...

1544
01:14:37,853 --> 01:14:41,123
(Do Gon and Ye Ji's first date begins.)

1545
01:14:41,123 --> 01:14:42,057
Here it is.

1546
01:14:43,492 --> 01:14:47,162
(The first stop on Do Gon's date plan)

1547
01:14:47,663 --> 01:14:51,233
(A roastery filled with coffee aromas)

1548
01:14:54,970 --> 01:14:56,105
Hello.

1549
01:14:56,105 --> 01:14:57,773
Hello.

1550
01:14:59,608 --> 01:15:00,976
Here's the menu.

1551
01:15:04,880 --> 01:15:07,182
This place is famous for...

1552
01:15:07,182 --> 01:15:11,954
selecting beans from roasters
in different regions...

1553
01:15:11,954 --> 01:15:14,723
and letting people try them here.

1554
01:15:15,224 --> 01:15:16,492
Then shall we try this one?

1555
01:15:21,864 --> 01:15:23,198
Are you buying?

1556
01:15:25,067 --> 01:15:26,168
It's only coffee.

1557
01:15:26,869 --> 01:15:28,537
- I'm the coffee lover here.
- Thank you.

1558
01:15:30,472 --> 01:15:34,009
(They share their tastes
and get to know each other.)

1559
01:15:35,177 --> 01:15:38,347
(Do Gon's recommended coffee arrives.)

1560
01:15:39,114 --> 01:15:40,949
- This is the signature drink?
- Yes.

1561
01:15:40,949 --> 01:15:41,984
Enjoy.

1562
01:15:44,520 --> 01:15:46,655
- We should take a picture.
- Definitely.

1563
01:15:47,656 --> 01:15:49,224
(Focused)

1564
01:15:52,661 --> 01:15:54,964
(A first date filled with coffee aromas)

1565
01:15:54,964 --> 01:15:57,132
Would you like to try it first?

1566
01:15:57,132 --> 01:15:58,167
You go first.

1567
01:15:58,167 --> 01:15:59,234
- Me first?
- Yes.

1568
01:15:59,935 --> 01:16:01,370
Let's have the expert try it.

1569
01:16:01,370 --> 01:16:02,604
(Like an expert,
he savors the aroma first.)

1570
01:16:07,643 --> 01:16:08,677
Is it good?

1571
01:16:09,645 --> 01:16:11,880
This doesn't even taste like coffee.

1572
01:16:11,880 --> 01:16:13,682
- You have to try this.
- Really?

1573
01:16:13,682 --> 01:16:15,184
We can share it, right?

1574
01:16:15,184 --> 01:16:16,452
Drink from this side.

1575
01:16:19,321 --> 01:16:20,255
(Sips)

1576
01:16:21,790 --> 01:16:22,758
What?

1577
01:16:25,160 --> 01:16:26,962
You don't look like you like it.

1578
01:16:26,962 --> 01:16:28,530
(Caught)

1579
01:16:28,530 --> 01:16:29,698
This is unique.

1580
01:16:30,966 --> 01:16:32,334
It's kind of refreshing too.

1581
01:16:32,334 --> 01:16:33,736
It looks like you're filtering your words.

1582
01:16:33,736 --> 01:16:35,170
You're trying to put it positively.

1583
01:16:36,505 --> 01:16:40,676
How did you feel after learning
everyone's ages and jobs yesterday?

1584
01:16:40,676 --> 01:16:42,511
Your age was somehow...

1585
01:16:42,511 --> 01:16:43,879
You thought so?

1586
01:16:43,879 --> 01:16:46,649
I felt like I could guess it,

1587
01:16:47,149 --> 01:16:49,084
though I was off by a year or two.

1588
01:16:49,084 --> 01:16:51,186
You just gave off that impression.

1589
01:16:51,186 --> 01:16:53,055
As for your job...

1590
01:16:53,055 --> 01:16:54,657
Did you expect it?

1591
01:16:54,657 --> 01:16:55,958
I was split between two things.

1592
01:16:55,958 --> 01:16:57,993
Either something in classical music...

1593
01:16:57,993 --> 01:17:00,129
or a job that involved speaking.

1594
01:17:00,129 --> 01:17:00,963
Really?

1595
01:17:00,963 --> 01:17:03,866
Your diction and pronunciation
are always so clear.

1596
01:17:03,866 --> 01:17:04,933
Really?

1597
01:17:05,200 --> 01:17:06,468
Did you guess mine?

1598
01:17:07,236 --> 01:17:08,737
- I did.
- Coffee?

1599
01:17:08,737 --> 01:17:09,838
Yes, coffee.

1600
01:17:10,372 --> 01:17:12,241
Or honestly,

1601
01:17:13,075 --> 01:17:16,211
I also considered something in marketing.

1602
01:17:16,211 --> 01:17:18,314
Or maybe an office job.

1603
01:17:21,750 --> 01:17:26,388
(Ye Ji struggles to focus on the date.)

1604
01:17:27,923 --> 01:17:29,558
Honestly, right now,

1605
01:17:29,558 --> 01:17:30,893
if I'm being completely honest,

1606
01:17:30,893 --> 01:17:32,995
I can't stop thinking about Seon Ho.

1607
01:17:32,995 --> 01:17:36,632
Ever since last night,

1608
01:17:36,632 --> 01:17:40,803
the moment I learned
Seon Ho would be staying at the House,

1609
01:17:40,803 --> 01:17:42,805
I couldn't stop thinking about it.

1610
01:17:42,805 --> 01:17:46,008
I wonder what he's thinking at the House,

1611
01:17:46,442 --> 01:17:49,678
and which of the other women
he might talk to there.

1612
01:17:49,678 --> 01:17:51,714
Those thoughts are bothering me,

1613
01:17:52,548 --> 01:17:54,450
but I honestly don't know anymore.

1614
01:17:56,018 --> 01:17:57,653
What are we going to do?

1615
01:17:57,653 --> 01:17:58,921
I didn't expect this.

1616
01:17:59,455 --> 01:18:01,223
(Laughs)

1617
01:18:01,223 --> 01:18:03,325
I wanted Ye Ji to be excited.

1618
01:18:03,325 --> 01:18:04,493
Goodness.

1619
01:18:05,461 --> 01:18:07,196
I wonder how Seon Ho is doing.

1620
01:18:07,429 --> 01:18:09,598
(Sighs)

1621
01:18:09,965 --> 01:18:12,568
(Meanwhile,)

1622
01:18:15,270 --> 01:18:19,141
(Seon Ho listens to music alone.)

1623
01:18:22,077 --> 01:18:23,879
(Off)

1624
01:18:28,050 --> 01:18:31,553
(He turns it off and leaves the playroom.)

1625
01:18:32,221 --> 01:18:35,691
(Meanwhile, Ro Bin stays at the House.)

1626
01:18:38,661 --> 01:18:39,528
Hello.

1627
01:18:39,528 --> 01:18:40,429
(Gestures)

1628
01:18:40,429 --> 01:18:41,297
What is it?

1629
01:18:41,297 --> 01:18:42,631
(She discreetly calls Seon Ho over.)

1630
01:18:42,631 --> 01:18:44,900
Has everyone gone out?

1631
01:18:44,900 --> 01:18:45,901
I'm not sure.

1632
01:18:45,901 --> 01:18:48,270
We should go out later too.

1633
01:18:48,270 --> 01:18:49,038
Okay.

1634
01:18:49,038 --> 01:18:51,874
What time do you want to leave?

1635
01:18:51,874 --> 01:18:53,409
Why do I keep speaking informally?

1636
01:18:53,409 --> 01:18:54,877
You can speak casually with me.

1637
01:18:54,877 --> 01:18:56,345
Wait.

1638
01:18:56,345 --> 01:18:57,279
You're older than me.

1639
01:18:57,279 --> 01:18:58,447
Can I call you by your name?

1640
01:18:58,447 --> 01:18:59,448
Sure. Whatever's comfortable.

1641
01:19:00,716 --> 01:19:01,984
(Flinches)

1642
01:19:01,984 --> 01:19:03,118
This is trouble.

1643
01:19:03,118 --> 01:19:04,987
She's already calling him by his name?

1644
01:19:04,987 --> 01:19:06,288
We're in trouble here.

1645
01:19:07,222 --> 01:19:08,724
- What do we do?
- Is this trouble?

1646
01:19:08,724 --> 01:19:10,392
This is serious. What do we do?

1647
01:19:10,392 --> 01:19:11,927
Wait.

1648
01:19:11,927 --> 01:19:13,095
My head hurts.

1649
01:19:14,430 --> 01:19:16,432
- What about Ye Ji?
- What about Ye Ji?

1650
01:19:16,799 --> 01:19:19,134
She can't even focus right now.

1651
01:19:19,134 --> 01:19:20,836
Ye Ji should've focused on her date.

1652
01:19:23,639 --> 01:19:25,741
Can I call you by your name?

1653
01:19:25,741 --> 01:19:26,809
Sure. Whatever's comfortable.

1654
01:19:26,809 --> 01:19:28,110
Then,

1655
01:19:28,110 --> 01:19:29,712
I'll get ready. Come out when you're done.

1656
01:19:30,079 --> 01:19:32,614
(The two decide to go out together.)

1657
01:19:32,614 --> 01:19:34,249
I'd been thinking...

1658
01:19:34,249 --> 01:19:36,652
that I wanted to talk with Seon Ho...

1659
01:19:36,652 --> 01:19:38,387
at least once.

1660
01:19:38,387 --> 01:19:40,389
The opportunity came up,

1661
01:19:40,389 --> 01:19:42,691
and since we were alone at the House,

1662
01:19:42,691 --> 01:19:45,794
I thought it would be nice to go out.

1663
01:19:46,195 --> 01:19:49,531
I rested and walked around the House,

1664
01:19:49,531 --> 01:19:51,934
then ran into Ro Bin.

1665
01:19:52,401 --> 01:19:54,336
She suddenly asked me to go out,

1666
01:19:54,336 --> 01:19:56,538
and I realized we could finally talk.

1667
01:19:57,940 --> 01:20:01,043
(Seon Ho finishes getting ready.)

1668
01:20:02,011 --> 01:20:06,248
(As he looks for Ro Bin,)

1669
01:20:09,585 --> 01:20:12,588
(he runs into Na Young alone.)

1670
01:20:12,588 --> 01:20:14,223
Are you going somewhere?

1671
01:20:14,223 --> 01:20:15,124
Are you heading out?

1672
01:20:15,124 --> 01:20:16,091
In a little while.

1673
01:20:20,095 --> 01:20:21,163
You're not going out?

1674
01:20:21,163 --> 01:20:22,097
No.

1675
01:20:22,564 --> 01:20:24,533
Are you and Ro Bin the only ones left?

1676
01:20:24,533 --> 01:20:25,434
Yes.

1677
01:20:27,369 --> 01:20:30,472
(Seon Ho waits for Ro Bin.)

1678
01:20:30,706 --> 01:20:33,142
Have you developed...

1679
01:20:33,142 --> 01:20:36,345
any romantic interest...

1680
01:20:36,345 --> 01:20:37,546
in anyone here?

1681
01:20:39,515 --> 01:20:40,916
(Curious)

1682
01:20:41,884 --> 01:20:43,319
For me, that's a little...

1683
01:20:45,587 --> 01:20:48,390
I prefer talking with someone first.

1684
01:20:48,390 --> 01:20:50,059
Of course. You only know after talking.

1685
01:20:51,760 --> 01:20:53,996
You definitely need to talk.

1686
01:20:53,996 --> 01:20:56,732
That's how you learn about someone.

1687
01:20:57,833 --> 01:20:59,435
(Nods)

1688
01:21:02,471 --> 01:21:05,341
Do you want to go on dates
with different people?

1689
01:21:06,475 --> 01:21:08,377
Yes. I want to talk with everyone.

1690
01:21:08,377 --> 01:21:09,244
Really?

1691
01:21:09,244 --> 01:21:10,346
I had no idea.

1692
01:21:10,346 --> 01:21:14,984
I thought you'd already chosen someone.

1693
01:21:14,984 --> 01:21:16,352
My feelings?

1694
01:21:16,352 --> 01:21:18,821
I can see why it looked that way.

1695
01:21:18,821 --> 01:21:19,989
So...

1696
01:21:19,989 --> 01:21:22,157
I kept wondering what I should do.

1697
01:21:22,157 --> 01:21:23,759
I really wanted to talk with you.

1698
01:21:23,759 --> 01:21:25,194
- Really?
- Yes.

1699
01:21:26,128 --> 01:21:28,464
(Seon Ho hears something unexpected.)

1700
01:21:28,464 --> 01:21:30,232
But on the other hand,

1701
01:21:30,232 --> 01:21:31,800
especially with you,

1702
01:21:31,800 --> 01:21:33,969
I thought asking to talk...

1703
01:21:33,969 --> 01:21:35,671
might make you feel pressured.

1704
01:21:36,839 --> 01:21:40,275
So once you felt more comfortable,

1705
01:21:40,275 --> 01:21:41,176
I thought I'd just...

1706
01:21:41,176 --> 01:21:42,911
casually...

1707
01:21:42,911 --> 01:21:44,079
strike up a conversation.

1708
01:21:45,614 --> 01:21:47,249
That might be the better approach,

1709
01:21:47,249 --> 01:21:49,251
but we have so little time.

1710
01:21:49,251 --> 01:21:50,319
It's just...

1711
01:21:51,086 --> 01:21:52,755
We only have a week.

1712
01:21:52,755 --> 01:21:54,657
We're already halfway through.

1713
01:21:57,192 --> 01:21:58,560
(Seon Ho hears Na Young's feelings
for the first time.)

1714
01:21:58,560 --> 01:21:59,495
This isn't easy.

1715
01:22:01,764 --> 01:22:04,900
I was surprised to hear...

1716
01:22:04,900 --> 01:22:06,902
that Na Young wanted to talk with me.

1717
01:22:06,902 --> 01:22:09,471
Our personalities seemed so different,

1718
01:22:09,471 --> 01:22:10,873
so I didn't expect it.

1719
01:22:12,608 --> 01:22:14,209
He seemed set on someone.

1720
01:22:14,209 --> 01:22:17,813
It looked like he'd gotten close
to just one person.

1721
01:22:17,813 --> 01:22:21,950
But he said that wasn't the case,

1722
01:22:21,950 --> 01:22:24,787
so I realized I'd been mistaken.

1723
01:22:24,787 --> 01:22:25,921
And that...

1724
01:22:25,921 --> 01:22:29,358
gave me some confidence.

1725
01:22:29,358 --> 01:22:30,793
(She gains the courage to approach him.)

1726
01:22:32,127 --> 01:22:33,262
(Surprised)

1727
01:22:33,262 --> 01:22:36,131
Na Young finally knows.

1728
01:22:36,498 --> 01:22:37,499
What do we do?

1729
01:22:38,367 --> 01:22:39,635
This is bad news.

1730
01:22:40,636 --> 01:22:41,804
You startled me.

1731
01:22:41,804 --> 01:22:42,972
That scared me!

1732
01:22:43,906 --> 01:22:45,307
You scared me.

1733
01:22:45,307 --> 01:22:46,608
She looked at me and said,

1734
01:22:46,608 --> 01:22:48,377
"This is bad news."

1735
01:22:48,377 --> 01:22:49,845
You startled me.

1736
01:22:49,845 --> 01:22:51,046
Your face was right here.

1737
01:22:52,181 --> 01:22:53,148
You scared me.

1738
01:22:53,782 --> 01:22:54,616
I'm sorry.

1739
01:22:56,185 --> 01:22:58,387
(Meanwhile)

1740
01:22:59,989 --> 01:23:01,991
Who have you talked with the most?

1741
01:23:01,991 --> 01:23:03,659
Honestly, I barely...

1742
01:23:03,659 --> 01:23:06,261
got to talk with anyone.

1743
01:23:06,261 --> 01:23:07,162
If I had to choose,

1744
01:23:08,430 --> 01:23:11,667
I think I talked with Seon Ho the most.

1745
01:23:11,667 --> 01:23:14,403
- I barely talked to the others.
- Really?

1746
01:23:16,271 --> 01:23:18,774
So I'm trying to talk more too.

1747
01:23:21,010 --> 01:23:22,311
- I guess...
- But...

1748
01:23:22,311 --> 01:23:23,379
You go first.

1749
01:23:23,879 --> 01:23:26,315
I never imagined I'd date you today.

1750
01:23:27,850 --> 01:23:29,618
- Why? Really?
- Yes.

1751
01:23:30,319 --> 01:23:31,587
You'd already been on...

1752
01:23:32,588 --> 01:23:34,356
about two dates now.

1753
01:23:35,224 --> 01:23:38,260
You'd dated other people,

1754
01:23:39,295 --> 01:23:42,364
so I didn't think...

1755
01:23:42,364 --> 01:23:44,366
you'd be curious about me.

1756
01:23:46,902 --> 01:23:48,337
I also felt...

1757
01:23:48,337 --> 01:23:50,539
we hadn't talked nearly enough.

1758
01:23:51,974 --> 01:23:54,910
But it looked like you still...

1759
01:23:54,910 --> 01:23:57,079
gave me some of your time too.

1760
01:24:03,352 --> 01:24:07,289
Was eating vegan food on your bucket list?

1761
01:24:07,289 --> 01:24:09,491
Not exactly.
It was just something I wanted to do.

1762
01:24:09,925 --> 01:24:12,561
I enjoy so many different things too.

1763
01:24:16,999 --> 01:24:19,301
(The date lasts for your combined time.)

1764
01:24:19,301 --> 01:24:22,638
(Jung Ye Ji and Han Do Gon,
your 110-minute date has ended.)

1765
01:24:23,605 --> 01:24:27,776
(Ye Ji, 100 minutes / Do Gon, 10 minutes)

1766
01:24:30,179 --> 01:24:35,150
(10 minutes returned
after she gave him 100.)

1767
01:24:37,252 --> 01:24:39,688
So many thoughts filled my mind.

1768
01:24:39,688 --> 01:24:42,791
I wanted to hurry back to the House...

1769
01:24:43,392 --> 01:24:45,427
and talk with Seon Ho.

1770
01:24:45,427 --> 01:24:47,663
That was all I could think about
on the way back.

1771
01:24:50,432 --> 01:24:51,634
See?

1772
01:24:51,634 --> 01:24:53,235
She wants to get home quickly.

1773
01:24:53,235 --> 01:24:56,105
Don't go home. Please don't.

1774
01:24:56,105 --> 01:24:58,941
What if Ye Ji walks in
while they're flirting?

1775
01:24:58,941 --> 01:25:00,909
I really don't want to see that.

1776
01:25:00,909 --> 01:25:02,611
- I really don't want to see it.
- Me neither.

1777
01:25:04,413 --> 01:25:06,081
(Meanwhile, at the House)

1778
01:25:07,216 --> 01:25:09,118
Seon Ho, let's go.

1779
01:25:09,618 --> 01:25:12,521
I'd wanted to talk with you anyway.

1780
01:25:13,122 --> 01:25:15,290
I'm so glad we got this opportunity.

1781
01:25:16,592 --> 01:25:19,695
(Seon Ho and Ro Bin get time alone.)

1782
01:25:20,029 --> 01:25:21,864
But don't you think...

1783
01:25:21,864 --> 01:25:23,365
the weather is so nice today?

1784
01:25:24,466 --> 01:25:25,668
That startled me.

1785
01:25:25,668 --> 01:25:26,602
Thank you.

1786
01:25:27,870 --> 01:25:29,104
The weather is beautiful.

1787
01:25:29,471 --> 01:25:30,773
It would be a shame to stay inside.

1788
01:25:30,773 --> 01:25:31,740
I really wanted to go out.

1789
01:25:31,740 --> 01:25:33,509
I was going to sit over there later.

1790
01:25:33,509 --> 01:25:34,977
Why don't we...

1791
01:25:34,977 --> 01:25:36,912
stop by a bakery
and eat the bread over there?

1792
01:25:36,912 --> 01:25:37,813
Sure. I'd like that.

1793
01:25:52,294 --> 01:25:54,730
You can speak casually with me.

1794
01:25:54,730 --> 01:25:55,831
Okay, I will.

1795
01:25:57,132 --> 01:25:58,133
This one?

1796
01:25:58,133 --> 01:25:59,201
That's not it.

1797
01:26:01,270 --> 01:26:03,005
(Close together)

1798
01:26:05,741 --> 01:26:10,546
(As the two leave for the bakery,)

1799
01:26:15,317 --> 01:26:19,688
(Ye Ji and Do Gon return from their date.)

1800
01:26:21,123 --> 01:26:24,326
(Only the navigation system
breaks the silence in the car.)

1801
01:26:25,728 --> 01:26:28,130
I haven't really had a chance...

1802
01:26:28,130 --> 01:26:30,199
to talk with you before, Seon Ho.

1803
01:26:30,199 --> 01:26:33,302
I'd ranked the people I wanted to know.

1804
01:26:33,302 --> 01:26:36,171
You were the second person
I wanted to talk with.

1805
01:26:36,171 --> 01:26:37,172
Really?

1806
01:26:37,172 --> 01:26:38,974
(Laughs)

1807
01:26:39,575 --> 01:26:41,777
Did you want to talk with me too?

1808
01:26:41,777 --> 01:26:42,978
- Yeah.
- Really?

1809
01:26:42,978 --> 01:26:45,114
You were the second person
I was curious about too.

1810
01:26:45,114 --> 01:26:46,048
Really?

1811
01:26:46,682 --> 01:26:48,884
Do you know you have a really nice smile?

1812
01:26:49,718 --> 01:26:51,120
You look so good when you smile.

1813
01:26:52,855 --> 01:26:54,523
Thanks.

1814
01:26:57,960 --> 01:26:59,461
No.

1815
01:27:00,929 --> 01:27:02,331
She complimented his smile.

1816
01:27:03,098 --> 01:27:04,900
"Do you know you have a nice smile?"

1817
01:27:05,868 --> 01:27:07,236
From now on,

1818
01:27:07,236 --> 01:27:08,671
I'm done making guesses or predictions.

1819
01:27:08,671 --> 01:27:10,639
I'm just going to watch.

1820
01:27:10,639 --> 01:27:12,941
This bad news...

1821
01:27:12,941 --> 01:27:14,276
This is bad news.

1822
01:27:14,276 --> 01:27:16,078
How will their conversation unfold?

1823
01:27:16,078 --> 01:27:18,113
(Sighs)

1824
01:27:19,481 --> 01:27:24,486
(Changes begin amid new connections.)

1825
01:27:26,488 --> 01:27:31,593
(Love Against Time)

1826
01:27:31,593 --> 01:27:32,962
I think yesterday was the real beginning.

1827
01:27:32,962 --> 01:27:34,229
I found myself forgetting a little.

1828
01:27:34,229 --> 01:27:35,898
Because I genuinely want to know...

1829
01:27:35,898 --> 01:27:37,933
whether it's attraction or something more.

1830
01:27:40,469 --> 01:27:41,770
It's a party for the ones left behind.

1831
01:27:41,770 --> 01:27:44,306
As soon as I returned,
I went looking for Seon Ho...

1832
01:27:44,306 --> 01:27:45,841
to ask how he spent his time.

1833
01:27:45,841 --> 01:27:47,142
Did you enjoy your date today?

1834
01:27:47,142 --> 01:27:49,011
Are there two people here you like?

1835
01:27:49,011 --> 01:27:50,679
What if his feelings have shifted?

1836
01:27:50,679 --> 01:27:53,649
Some people have shown interest in me.

1837
01:27:53,649 --> 01:27:54,616
This is really hard.

1838
01:27:54,616 --> 01:27:55,617
Is it hard?

1839
01:27:55,617 --> 01:27:57,252
Did you want to spend time with me?

1840
01:27:57,252 --> 01:27:58,220
Today?

1841
01:27:59,154 --> 01:28:01,223
It's either a yes or a no.

1842
01:28:01,223 --> 01:28:02,624
(The shocking choices made that night)

1843
01:28:02,624 --> 01:28:03,592
Why?

1844
01:28:04,226 --> 01:28:05,127
Why?

1845
01:28:05,127 --> 01:28:06,895
No. This really can't happen.

1846
01:28:06,895 --> 01:28:08,330
I knew I had to go on a date with him.

1847
01:28:08,330 --> 01:28:09,198
So I wouldn't have any regrets.

1848
01:28:09,198 --> 01:28:10,733
Don't hesitate
or let yourself get confused.

1849
01:28:10,733 --> 01:28:12,034
Just follow your heart.

1850
01:28:12,034 --> 01:28:13,936
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
